('2d694261-125e-4ce3-8910-e9449de53f24', 'en', 'Spread cooked beef mixture evenly into a 9x13-inch baking dish. Sprinkle Cheddar cheese on top and arrange crispy waffle fries in an even layer over the cheese. Sprinkle mozzarella over waffle fries, followed by chopped bacon.'),
('2d694261-125e-4ce3-8910-e9449de53f24', 'ko', 'Spread cooked beef mixture evenly into a 9x13-inch baking dish. Sprinkle Cheddar cheese on top and arrange crispy waffle fries in an even layer over the cheese. Sprinkle mozzarella over waffle fries, followed by chopped bacon.'),
('197f339f-95d9-4909-80c3-4dd7f289ee55', 'en', 'Bake casserole in the preheated oven just until cheese is melted and casserole is heated through, about 5 minutes.'),
