('1d28bf79-10d0-4495-829f-2768f98eb62a', 'en', 'Place eggs in a saucepan and cover with water. Bring to boil. Cover, remove from heat, and let eggs sit in hot water for 10 to 12 minutes. Remove from hot water, cool, and peel.'),
