('70e3c921-d2f1-4b47-891a-d799cc690802', 'en', 'Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil. Add potatoes and cook until tender but still firm, about 15 minutes. Drain and mash. Mix in butter, finely chopped onion and 1/4 cup shredded cheese. Season with salt and pepper to taste; set aside.'),
('70e3c921-d2f1-4b47-891a-d799cc690802', 'ko', 'Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil. Add potatoes and cook until tender but still firm, about 15 minutes. Drain and mash. Mix in butter, finely chopped onion and 1/4 cup shredded cheese. Season with salt and pepper to taste; set aside.'),
('9f23497d-39d7-460d-81da-87c0e2c26775', 'en', 'Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil. Add carrots and cook until tender but still firm, about 15 minutes. Drain, mash and set aside. Preheat oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C.)'),
('9f23497d-39d7-460d-81da-87c0e2c26775', 'ko', 'Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil. Add carrots and cook until tender but still firm, about 15 minutes. Drain, mash and set aside. Preheat oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C.)'),
('8de755ee-f70c-4c8e-8151-85f2736d9e47', 'en', 'Heat oil in a large frying pan. Add onion and cook until clear. Add ground beef and cook until well browned. Pour off excess fat, then stir in flour and cook 1 minute. Add ketchup and beef broth. Bring to a boil, reduce heat and simmer for 5 minutes.'),
('8de755ee-f70c-4c8e-8151-85f2736d9e47', 'ko', 'Heat oil in a large frying pan. Add onion and cook until clear. Add ground beef and cook until well browned. Pour off excess fat, then stir in flour and cook 1 minute. Add ketchup and beef broth. Bring to a boil, reduce heat and simmer for 5 minutes.'),
('b279a464-8300-42e7-8752-c744c68a9114', 'en', 'Spread the ground beef in an even layer on the bottom of a 2 quart casserole dish. Next, spread a layer of mashed carrots. Top with the mashed potato mixture and sprinkle with remaining shredded cheese.'),
('b279a464-8300-42e7-8752-c744c68a9114', 'ko', 'Spread the ground beef in an even layer on the bottom of a 2 quart casserole dish. Next, spread a layer of mashed carrots. Top with the mashed potato mixture and sprinkle with remaining shredded cheese.'),
('77498866-f6f1-4d77-8bd5-e1178044242c', 'en', 'Bake in the preheated oven for 20 minutes, or until golden brown. Serve hot and enjoy!'),
('77498866-f6f1-4d77-8bd5-e1178044242c', 'ko', 'Bake in the preheated oven for 20 minutes, or until golden brown. Serve hot and enjoy!'),
('b7ddafd3-89c6-45ad-8f45-9e54c9c4a0c4', 'en', 'Combine mayonnaise, minced chipotle peppers, lime juice, honey, avocado oil, 1 teaspoon cumin, and salt to taste for the slaw in a large bowl. Stir until well blended. Add shredded cabbage and toss to coat. Refrigerate until ready to use.'),
('b7ddafd3-89c6-45ad-8f45-9e54c9c4a0c4', 'ko', 'Combine mayonnaise, minced chipotle peppers, lime juice, honey, avocado oil, 1 teaspoon cumin, and salt to taste for the slaw in a large bowl. Stir until well blended. Add shredded cabbage and toss to coat. Refrigerate until ready to use.'),
('c0c08b2c-5f50-4e3b-833d-c47562b411d8', 'en', 'Combine water, sofrito base, and cayenne pepper in a large skillet for the slaw. Bring to a boil over medium heat. Add shrimp to the boiling liquid, bring back to a boil, and cook until shrimp turn white and peachy-pink, and make a "C" shape, 3 to 5 minutes. Using a slotted spoon or spider, remove shrimp from the cooking liquid immediately.'),
('c0c08b2c-5f50-4e3b-833d-c47562b411d8', 'ko', 'Combine water, sofrito base, and cayenne pepper in a large skillet for the slaw. Bring to a boil over medium heat. Add shrimp to the boiling liquid, bring back to a boil, and cook until shrimp turn white and peachy-pink, and make a "C" shape, 3 to 5 minutes. Using a slotted spoon or spider, remove shrimp from the cooking liquid immediately.'),
('96223cf2-a67a-4d55-81dd-8312ee6b6716', 'en', 'Set an oven rack about 6 inches from the heat source and preheat the broiler. Line a baking tray with aluminum foil.'),
('96223cf2-a67a-4d55-81dd-8312ee6b6716', 'ko', 'Set an oven rack about 6 inches from the heat source and preheat the broiler. Line a baking tray with aluminum foil.'),
('3dad20a6-67fd-45fc-8b15-19c263066275', 'en', 'Stir refried beans, smoked paprika, 1/2 teaspoon cumin, and garlic granules together in a bowl for the tostadas. Spread each tostada shell with bean mixture, 1 to 2 tablespoons per tostada, or to taste. Sprinkle queso fresco crumbles evenly on each tostada. Place tostadas on the prepared baking tray in a single layer.'),
('3dad20a6-67fd-45fc-8b15-19c263066275', 'ko', 'Stir refried beans, smoked paprika, 1/2 teaspoon cumin, and garlic granules together in a bowl for the tostadas. Spread each tostada shell with bean mixture, 1 to 2 tablespoons per tostada, or to taste. Sprinkle queso fresco crumbles evenly on each tostada. Place tostadas on the prepared baking tray in a single layer.'),
('9de52996-0a24-4e61-8e93-32f4dfb2ea0b', 'en', 'Broil under the preheated broiler until cheese begins to melt, 1 to 2 minutes. Watch that tostada shells do not burn.'),
('9de52996-0a24-4e61-8e93-32f4dfb2ea0b', 'ko', 'Broil under the preheated broiler until cheese begins to melt, 1 to 2 minutes. Watch that tostada shells do not burn.'),
('2b42c47e-1bd3-461b-89b9-e73add1591c2', 'en', 'Place about 1/2 cup of the prepared slaw on each tostada. Top with chopped cilantro to taste. Add three shrimp per tostada, and drizzle crema over all. Serve with lime slices, if desired.'),
('2b42c47e-1bd3-461b-89b9-e73add1591c2', 'ko', 'Place about 1/2 cup of the prepared slaw on each tostada. Top with chopped cilantro to taste. Add three shrimp per tostada, and drizzle crema over all. Serve with lime slices, if desired.'),
('6aa57482-cb39-4993-85ab-68e32b272217', 'en', 'Set chicken breast onto a cutting board and make 5 or 6 shallow cuts through the skin. Season generously on both sides with salt.'),
('6aa57482-cb39-4993-85ab-68e32b272217', 'ko', 'Set chicken breast onto a cutting board and make 5 or 6 shallow cuts through the skin. Season generously on both sides with salt.'),
('b4417009-52f7-4706-8fa5-68a1619818b8', 'en', 'Heat vegetable oil in a skillet over medium high heat and sear chicken breast, skin-side down, until the skin is golden brown and fat has rendered out, about 5 minutes. Flip breast over, and keep cooking until chicken is cooked through, about 5 minutes more. If oil starts to smoke before the chicken is cooked, reduce heat to medium or medium-low.'),
('b4417009-52f7-4706-8fa5-68a1619818b8', 'ko', 'Heat vegetable oil in a skillet over medium high heat and sear chicken breast, skin-side down, until the skin is golden brown and fat has rendered out, about 5 minutes. Flip breast over, and keep cooking until chicken is cooked through, about 5 minutes more. If oil starts to smoke before the chicken is cooked, reduce heat to medium or medium-low.'),
('9fc75d61-a492-4f39-8b5c-ab5d0ba6707b', 'en', 'Turn off the heat and transfer chicken to a plate to rest until cool enough to handle. Peel off the skin and finely chop. Refrigerate chicken breast.'),
('9fc75d61-a492-4f39-8b5c-ab5d0ba6707b', 'ko', 'Turn off the heat and transfer chicken to a plate to rest until cool enough to handle. Peel off the skin and finely chop. Refrigerate chicken breast.'),
('f6e0a928-5575-4d12-8c1d-50c176a0a1fb', 'en', 'Add minced chicken skin back into the skillet over and medium heat. Cook and stir until the skin browns and starts getting crisp, 3 to 5 minutes. Add ginger, garlic, and onions and cook, stirring, until onions start to turn translucent, about 5 minutes. Add turmeric and rice; cook and stir until rice is well coated with oil, 2 to 3 minutes.'),
('f6e0a928-5575-4d12-8c1d-50c176a0a1fb', 'ko', 'Add minced chicken skin back into the skillet over and medium heat. Cook and stir until the skin browns and starts getting crisp, 3 to 5 minutes. Add ginger, garlic, and onions and cook, stirring, until onions start to turn translucent, about 5 minutes. Add turmeric and rice; cook and stir until rice is well coated with oil, 2 to 3 minutes.'),
('a5cf052b-f4ec-4d84-84d0-6c54a47286b2', 'en', 'Stir in broth, turn heat to high, and bring to a boil. Cover, reduce heat to low, and simmer undisturbed for 20 minutes. Turn off the heat and set a timer for 10 minutes to allow rice to rest.'),
('a5cf052b-f4ec-4d84-84d0-6c54a47286b2', 'ko', 'Stir in broth, turn heat to high, and bring to a boil. Cover, reduce heat to low, and simmer undisturbed for 20 minutes. Turn off the heat and set a timer for 10 minutes to allow rice to rest.'),
('5dd6030f-cccd-4dcd-847d-5ee1f8bdf9b0', 'en', 'Meanwhile, shred the chicken meat using your hands or cut into small pieces. Place into a bowl. Add red onion, green onions, Fresno chili, lime juice, soy sauce, hot sauce, sesame oil, salt, pepper, fresh mint and cilantro. Toss until well combined. Taste and adjust with more lime juice, salt, and/or spice as needed.'),
('5dd6030f-cccd-4dcd-847d-5ee1f8bdf9b0', 'ko', 'Meanwhile, shred the chicken meat using your hands or cut into small pieces. Place into a bowl. Add red onion, green onions, Fresno chili, lime juice, soy sauce, hot sauce, sesame oil, salt, pepper, fresh mint and cilantro. Toss until well combined. Taste and adjust with more lime juice, salt, and/or spice as needed.'),
('a7766e50-3841-4932-8b20-ab1b6e541107', 'en', 'After the 10 minute rice timer is up, remove cover, and fluff rice with a fork. Taste and adjust seasoning if necessary. Serve rice topped with the chicken herb salad mixture and lime wedges.'),
('a7766e50-3841-4932-8b20-ab1b6e541107', 'ko', 'After the 10 minute rice timer is up, remove cover, and fluff rice with a fork. Taste and adjust seasoning if necessary. Serve rice topped with the chicken herb salad mixture and lime wedges.'),
('6ae44d2a-6b7c-485d-8820-33d768ad63a0', 'en', 'Preheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Add pasta and cook for 8 to 10 minutes or until al dente; drain.'),
('6ae44d2a-6b7c-485d-8820-33d768ad63a0', 'ko', 'Preheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Add pasta and cook for 8 to 10 minutes or until al dente; drain.'),
('c6a4ec5c-78a7-4de1-8725-ec2ff3cb1015', 'en', 'Coat a large skillet with non-stick cooking spray, and place over medium heat. Saute onion, red bell pepper, corn and garlic until tender. Stir in black beans, refried beans, tomato sauce, salsa and 1/4 cup cilantro. Cook until heated through and slightly thickened; set aside.'),
('c6a4ec5c-78a7-4de1-8725-ec2ff3cb1015', 'ko', 'Coat a large skillet with non-stick cooking spray, and place over medium heat. Saute onion, red bell pepper, corn and garlic until tender. Stir in black beans, refried beans, tomato sauce, salsa and 1/4 cup cilantro. Cook until heated through and slightly thickened; set aside.'),
('91a2c4b1-2105-424c-8d9d-ea1c583ca537', 'en', 'In a large bowl, combine cottage cheese, ricotta, sour cream, shredded Monterey Jack cheese and remaining 1/4 cup chopped cilantro; set aside.'),
('91a2c4b1-2105-424c-8d9d-ea1c583ca537', 'ko', 'In a large bowl, combine cottage cheese, ricotta, sour cream, shredded Monterey Jack cheese and remaining 1/4 cup chopped cilantro; set aside.'),
('05b9efe9-d27c-425d-8ccd-4adcd7688e64', 'en', 'Coat a 9x13 inch casserole dish with non-stick cooking spray. Arrange 3 of the cooked lasagna noodles in the bottom of the dish, cutting to fit if necessary. Spread with 1/3 of the bean mixture, then 1/3 of the cheese mixture. Repeat layers twice more.'),
('05b9efe9-d27c-425d-8ccd-4adcd7688e64', 'ko', 'Coat a 9x13 inch casserole dish with non-stick cooking spray. Arrange 3 of the cooked lasagna noodles in the bottom of the dish, cutting to fit if necessary. Spread with 1/3 of the bean mixture, then 1/3 of the cheese mixture. Repeat layers twice more.'),
('a6dc788e-c5b2-4dc5-8c90-9b8e66dd4233', 'en', 'Cover, and bake in preheated oven for 45 minutes. Garnish with sliced black olives and sprigs of cilantro.'),
('a6dc788e-c5b2-4dc5-8c90-9b8e66dd4233', 'ko', 'Cover, and bake in preheated oven for 45 minutes. Garnish with sliced black olives and sprigs of cilantro.'),
('ff98ec21-6560-440c-8291-976c9eb09a17', 'en', 'Place onion in a food processor and process to a medium chop. Use a garlic press to add garlic to the chopped onion.'),
('ff98ec21-6560-440c-8291-976c9eb09a17', 'ko', 'Place onion in a food processor and process to a medium chop. Use a garlic press to add garlic to the chopped onion.'),
('e29457fa-3ee4-483d-83ba-9372f7e2bc9b', 'en', 'Preheat a saute pan over medium-high heat. Add oil, onion, and garlic to the hot pan. Reduce heat to medium and saute until golden, about 5 minutes.'),
('e29457fa-3ee4-483d-83ba-9372f7e2bc9b', 'ko', 'Preheat a saute pan over medium-high heat. Add oil, onion, and garlic to the hot pan. Reduce heat to medium and saute until golden, about 5 minutes.'),
('94b95c3a-ef94-4f5f-86ea-d32911acea52', 'en', 'Place mushrooms in the food processor and process to a medium dice. Stir into the onion mixture and cook for 3 to 4 minutes. Meanwhile, process olives to a fine mince and set aside.'),
('94b95c3a-ef94-4f5f-86ea-d32911acea52', 'ko', 'Place mushrooms in the food processor and process to a medium dice. Stir into the onion mixture and cook for 3 to 4 minutes. Meanwhile, process olives to a fine mince and set aside.'),
('bd71fce6-6f0e-4647-8e53-4c03861d5831', 'en', 'Add oregano, paprika, cumin, red pepper flakes, and pepper to the pan; cook and stir until fragrant, 1 to 2 minutes. Crumble in ground beef and cook, breaking up with a spoon or spatula, until thoroughly browned, 5 to 8 minutes. Stir in olives. Remove from heat and cool for 20 to 30 minutes, stirring occasionally.'),
('bd71fce6-6f0e-4647-8e53-4c03861d5831', 'ko', 'Add oregano, paprika, cumin, red pepper flakes, and pepper to the pan; cook and stir until fragrant, 1 to 2 minutes. Crumble in ground beef and cook, breaking up with a spoon or spatula, until thoroughly browned, 5 to 8 minutes. Stir in olives. Remove from heat and cool for 20 to 30 minutes, stirring occasionally.'),
('848535bb-5781-4acd-8870-a39a4d72b82f', 'en', 'Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Spray a 9-inch pie plate with cooking spray. Line the plate with 1 pie crust.'),
('848535bb-5781-4acd-8870-a39a4d72b82f', 'ko', 'Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Spray a 9-inch pie plate with cooking spray. Line the plate with 1 pie crust.'),
('e2fef6d2-7b02-40fe-8ac4-47c8595f8777', 'en', 'Carefully spoon the cooled beef mixture into the crust. Press the second crust on top. Slice air vents in the top crust.'),
('e2fef6d2-7b02-40fe-8ac4-47c8595f8777', 'ko', 'Carefully spoon the cooled beef mixture into the crust. Press the second crust on top. Slice air vents in the top crust.'),
('2c7fa895-4119-4eae-8fb8-47aa04e547ca', 'en', 'Beat egg and water together in a small bowl. Brush egg wash thoroughly over the complete surface of the pie.'),
('2c7fa895-4119-4eae-8fb8-47aa04e547ca', 'ko', 'Beat egg and water together in a small bowl. Brush egg wash thoroughly over the complete surface of the pie.'),
('9f829e10-b615-4a12-86c8-8eb61f26aebe', 'en', 'Bake in the preheated oven until crust is golden brown, 45 to 50 minutes. Let cool for 5 to 10 minutes before cutting and serving.'),
('9f829e10-b615-4a12-86c8-8eb61f26aebe', 'ko', 'Bake in the preheated oven until crust is golden brown, 45 to 50 minutes. Let cool for 5 to 10 minutes before cutting and serving.'),
('b4577802-d64c-4804-8bb0-12b24e7f84cb', 'en', 'Gather all ingredients.'),
('b4577802-d64c-4804-8bb0-12b24e7f84cb', 'ko', 'Gather all ingredients.'),
('9f230881-0a7c-4511-88ee-cbd0e718be82', 'en', 'Cut each potato lengthwise into 3/8-inch-thick slices, then slice sections into 3/8-inch-wide sticks. Place potatoes in a bowl of cold water. Let soak to release excess starches, about 5 minutes; drain.'),
('9f230881-0a7c-4511-88ee-cbd0e718be82', 'ko', 'Cut each potato lengthwise into 3/8-inch-thick slices, then slice sections into 3/8-inch-wide sticks. Place potatoes in a bowl of cold water. Let soak to release excess starches, about 5 minutes; drain.'),
('31128ad0-be9c-4265-8c89-b7e9e7c52577', 'en', 'Pour boiling water over the potatoes until they''re covered by a few inches. Let sit for 10 minutes. Drain potatoes and transfer onto some paper towels. Blot off excess water and let cool completely, at least 10 minutes.'),
('31128ad0-be9c-4265-8c89-b7e9e7c52577', 'ko', 'Pour boiling water over the potatoes until they''re covered by a few inches. Let sit for 10 minutes. Drain potatoes and transfer onto some paper towels. Blot off excess water and let cool completely, at least 10 minutes.'),
('0e08b18d-72e4-48fb-826b-734caa68d8fa', 'en', 'Place cooled potatoes in a mixing bowl. Drizzle with oil and season with cayenne; toss to coat.'),
('0e08b18d-72e4-48fb-826b-734caa68d8fa', 'ko', 'Place cooled potatoes in a mixing bowl. Drizzle with oil and season with cayenne; toss to coat.'),
('332618c7-1653-4a5e-8cf2-984a41ba4781', 'en', 'Preheat an air fryer to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).'),
('332618c7-1653-4a5e-8cf2-984a41ba4781', 'ko', 'Preheat an air fryer to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).'),
('8fdd18c2-cb99-4610-8b43-ae1485aec036', 'en', 'Stack potatoes in a double layer in the fryer basket.'),
('8fdd18c2-cb99-4610-8b43-ae1485aec036', 'ko', 'Stack potatoes in a double layer in the fryer basket.'),
('98571f72-3e07-45a6-8b1b-28a3c7067e30', 'en', 'Cook for 15 minutes. Slide basket out and toss fries. Continue frying until golden brown, about 10 minutes more. Toss fries with salt in a mixing bowl. Serve immediately.'),
('98571f72-3e07-45a6-8b1b-28a3c7067e30', 'ko', 'Cook for 15 minutes. Slide basket out and toss fries. Continue frying until golden brown, about 10 minutes more. Toss fries with salt in a mixing bowl. Serve immediately.'),
('5d63043e-1e2e-48bb-8e23-d5b52ca4a3e1', 'en', 'Preheat an air fryer to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).'),
('5d63043e-1e2e-48bb-8e23-d5b52ca4a3e1', 'ko', 'Preheat an air fryer to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).'),
('b20049d4-bb94-427d-8695-3a19a1d009aa', 'en', 'Slice tips off the plantain. Make a vertical cut in the skin from end to end, making sure to cut only through the thick skin and not into the plantain flesh. Cut plantain, still with the peel, into 1-inch chunks. Peel the skin off each chunk starting at the slit you made.'),
('b20049d4-bb94-427d-8695-3a19a1d009aa', 'ko', 'Slice tips off the plantain. Make a vertical cut in the skin from end to end, making sure to cut only through the thick skin and not into the plantain flesh. Cut plantain, still with the peel, into 1-inch chunks. Peel the skin off each chunk starting at the slit you made.'),
('45e8d096-5148-46a9-82d7-e4030fa19a59', 'en', 'Place the plantain chunks in your air fryer basket and spray them with olive oil spray. Air fry for 5 minutes. Meanwhile, prepare a bowl of salted water.'),
('45e8d096-5148-46a9-82d7-e4030fa19a59', 'ko', 'Place the plantain chunks in your air fryer basket and spray them with olive oil spray. Air fry for 5 minutes. Meanwhile, prepare a bowl of salted water.'),
('e26dc844-120c-4c27-836f-35fcc867bc03', 'en', 'Remove the plantain pieces from the air fryer with tongs. Smash to about 1/2-inch thickness using a tostonera (plantain smasher). Soak the smashed tostones in the bowl of salted water while smashing the rest.'),
('e26dc844-120c-4c27-836f-35fcc867bc03', 'ko', 'Remove the plantain pieces from the air fryer with tongs. Smash to about 1/2-inch thickness using a tostonera (plantain smasher). Soak the smashed tostones in the bowl of salted water while smashing the rest.'),
('bf645baa-abb9-43ee-85a9-0adf94acd6dd', 'en', 'Remove the tostones from the salted water and pat dry with a paper towel.'),
('bf645baa-abb9-43ee-85a9-0adf94acd6dd', 'ko', 'Remove the tostones from the salted water and pat dry with a paper towel.'),
('4bfea9fb-87ff-4450-836a-1fe8193c65d3', 'en', 'Return tostones to the air fryer in batches, filling the basket with a single layer each time. Spray the tops with olive oil spray and season with salt; air fry for 5 minutes. Flip with tongs and spray the other side with olive oil spray. Season with salt. Air fry until golden brown and crisp, 4 to 5 minutes more.'),
('4bfea9fb-87ff-4450-836a-1fe8193c65d3', 'ko', 'Return tostones to the air fryer in batches, filling the basket with a single layer each time. Spray the tops with olive oil spray and season with salt; air fry for 5 minutes. Flip with tongs and spray the other side with olive oil spray. Season with salt. Air fry until golden brown and crisp, 4 to 5 minutes more.'),
('ca466275-5dcd-4976-8679-600970775238', 'en', 'Cook tomato on a ridged grill pan over medium-high heat until slightly blackened, about 5 minutes. Remove from heat and cool until easily handled. Peel off skin and remove seeds.'),
('ca466275-5dcd-4976-8679-600970775238', 'ko', 'Cook tomato on a ridged grill pan over medium-high heat until slightly blackened, about 5 minutes. Remove from heat and cool until easily handled. Peel off skin and remove seeds.'),
('236e117c-0173-41e3-8497-b51cbca41c19', 'en', 'Bring a small pot of water to a boil. Add guajillo and ancho chile peppers; cook until softened, about 5 minutes. Drain.'),
('236e117c-0173-41e3-8497-b51cbca41c19', 'ko', 'Bring a small pot of water to a boil. Add guajillo and ancho chile peppers; cook until softened, about 5 minutes. Drain.'),
('ffd0f876-ff84-48d9-861e-6e7695cd30fa', 'en', 'Combine tomato flesh, softened chile peppers, 2 slices pineapple, orange juice, quartered onion, vinegar, chipotle peppers, salt, garlic, cloves, cumin seeds, and oregano in a blender; blend until smooth.'),
('ffd0f876-ff84-48d9-861e-6e7695cd30fa', 'ko', 'Combine tomato flesh, softened chile peppers, 2 slices pineapple, orange juice, quartered onion, vinegar, chipotle peppers, salt, garlic, cloves, cumin seeds, and oregano in a blender; blend until smooth.'),
('c0d89aa0-e7dc-4a77-82c9-fbffb62bf4b0', 'en', 'Arrange pork slices in a glass or ceramic baking dish. Pour blended mixture over pork, ensuring all sides are evenly coated. Cover baking dish with plastic wrap.'),
('c0d89aa0-e7dc-4a77-82c9-fbffb62bf4b0', 'ko', 'Arrange pork slices in a glass or ceramic baking dish. Pour blended mixture over pork, ensuring all sides are evenly coated. Cover baking dish with plastic wrap.'),
('9573f28d-ce3e-4293-8d05-a355b8b26180', 'en', 'Marinate pork in the refrigerator, 4 hours to overnight.'),
('9573f28d-ce3e-4293-8d05-a355b8b26180', 'ko', 'Marinate pork in the refrigerator, 4 hours to overnight.'),
('b3538b51-2667-4d66-87ca-583433b1441d', 'en', 'Cook remaining pineapple slices on a ridged grill pan over medium-high heat until slightly blackened and soft, about 5 minutes per side. Chop into small pieces.'),
('b3538b51-2667-4d66-87ca-583433b1441d', 'ko', 'Cook remaining pineapple slices on a ridged grill pan over medium-high heat until slightly blackened and soft, about 5 minutes per side. Chop into small pieces.'),
('1df481d3-6147-469e-8187-d0b8f8eb7244', 'en', 'Wipe out grill pan and preheat over medium-high heat. Cook marinated pork in the hot pan, turning once, until browned, 4 to 5 minutes.'),
('1df481d3-6147-469e-8187-d0b8f8eb7244', 'ko', 'Wipe out grill pan and preheat over medium-high heat. Cook marinated pork in the hot pan, turning once, until browned, 4 to 5 minutes.'),
('b45fec06-4fdf-4e9c-8271-c3a7579d4863', 'en', 'Chop pork coarsely into small pieces against the grain. Serve with pineapple, chopped onion, and cilantro.'),
('b45fec06-4fdf-4e9c-8271-c3a7579d4863', 'ko', 'Chop pork coarsely into small pieces against the grain. Serve with pineapple, chopped onion, and cilantro.'),
('0e2f6524-8b8f-4bcb-88c4-1258084f578c', 'en', 'Make the dipping sauce: Mix cream cheese, crème fraîche, green onions, and lime juice together in a bowl. If mixture seems too thick, add enough water to thin it to your preferred consistency.'),
('0e2f6524-8b8f-4bcb-88c4-1258084f578c', 'ko', 'Make the dipping sauce: Mix cream cheese, crème fraîche, green onions, and lime juice together in a bowl. If mixture seems too thick, add enough water to thin it to your preferred consistency.'),
('2e6fb90a-0c7a-4c74-848c-d99044b7a9bf', 'en', 'Make the puffs: Place bacon in a large skillet and cook over medium-high heat, turning occasionally, until evenly browned and crisp, about 10 minutes. Drain bacon slices on paper towels. Crumble or finely chop. Drain fat from skillet, reserving 1 tablespoon.'),
('2e6fb90a-0c7a-4c74-848c-d99044b7a9bf', 'ko', 'Make the puffs: Place bacon in a large skillet and cook over medium-high heat, turning occasionally, until evenly browned and crisp, about 10 minutes. Drain bacon slices on paper towels. Crumble or finely chop. Drain fat from skillet, reserving 1 tablespoon.'),
('d3921277-fd4a-4124-85ed-24aa8604638f', 'en', 'Place skillet over medium-high heat. Add cold water, butter, reserved bacon fat, and salt. Bring mixture to a simmer; reduce heat to medium. Pour in flour all at once. Stir to mix and mash with a wooden spoon until dough starts to pull together, 2 to 3 minutes. Remove pan from heat; transfer dough to a mixing bowl and let cool for about 5 minutes.'),
('d3921277-fd4a-4124-85ed-24aa8604638f', 'ko', 'Place skillet over medium-high heat. Add cold water, butter, reserved bacon fat, and salt. Bring mixture to a simmer; reduce heat to medium. Pour in flour all at once. Stir to mix and mash with a wooden spoon until dough starts to pull together, 2 to 3 minutes. Remove pan from heat; transfer dough to a mixing bowl and let cool for about 5 minutes.'),
('be4c6ff6-02d7-4727-8059-1b1747996a43', 'en', 'When dough is cool, whisk in 1 egg. Mixture will separate slightly. Continue whisking in first egg until mixture pulls back together. Repeat with the second egg. Scrape down sides of bowl. Add diced jalapeño, bacon pieces, shredded cheese, cayenne pepper, and black pepper. Mix thoroughly with a spatula. Wrap dough in plastic wrap and refrigerate until cool, 30 minutes to 1 hour.'),
('be4c6ff6-02d7-4727-8059-1b1747996a43', 'ko', 'When dough is cool, whisk in 1 egg. Mixture will separate slightly. Continue whisking in first egg until mixture pulls back together. Repeat with the second egg. Scrape down sides of bowl. Add diced jalapeño, bacon pieces, shredded cheese, cayenne pepper, and black pepper. Mix thoroughly with a spatula. Wrap dough in plastic wrap and refrigerate until cool, 30 minutes to 1 hour.'),
('ece53e12-17f9-4511-8bf3-cdc9728adf57', 'en', 'Heat oil in a deep fryer to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).'),
('ece53e12-17f9-4511-8bf3-cdc9728adf57', 'ko', 'Heat oil in a deep fryer to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).'),
('11defba1-c9d5-4fa9-8648-36ea93929cec', 'en', 'Using a small scoop, scoop out rounds of dough. Drop rounds of dough into hot oil and cook until golden brown and cooked through, 3 to 4 minutes. Work in batches if necessary. Transfer to a cooling rack.'),
('11defba1-c9d5-4fa9-8648-36ea93929cec', 'ko', 'Using a small scoop, scoop out rounds of dough. Drop rounds of dough into hot oil and cook until golden brown and cooked through, 3 to 4 minutes. Work in batches if necessary. Transfer to a cooling rack.'),
('0d4528f2-c005-47b8-8325-7b306afcc72c', 'en', 'Serve with dipping sauce garnished with a few green onion slices.'),
('0d4528f2-c005-47b8-8325-7b306afcc72c', 'ko', 'Serve with dipping sauce garnished with a few green onion slices.'),
('0b2a8ae0-f3a2-46bc-80a4-3da01c47d295', 'en', 'Heat olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Season steaks generously with salt, black pepper, and cayenne. Cook steaks in hot oil for 5 to 6 minutes. Flip and add onions around steaks. Continue cooking until steaks begin to firm and are hot and slightly pink in the center, 5 to 6 minutes more. Push onions under steaks and cook until browned but still crunchy, 2 to 3 minutes more. Remove steaks and sautéed onions to a plate.'),
('0b2a8ae0-f3a2-46bc-80a4-3da01c47d295', 'ko', 'Heat olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Season steaks generously with salt, black pepper, and cayenne. Cook steaks in hot oil for 5 to 6 minutes. Flip and add onions around steaks. Continue cooking until steaks begin to firm and are hot and slightly pink in the center, 5 to 6 minutes more. Push onions under steaks and cook until browned but still crunchy, 2 to 3 minutes more. Remove steaks and sautéed onions to a plate.'),
('d4fcd256-ccea-4e52-8ddc-dd1db65a69f2', 'en', 'Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Line a baking tray with aluminum foil.'),
('d4fcd256-ccea-4e52-8ddc-dd1db65a69f2', 'ko', 'Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Line a baking tray with aluminum foil.'),
('805e007d-6d18-443a-80c7-1deed9c26d75', 'en', 'Place rolls on the prepared baking tray. Hollow out the top of each roll by cutting in at a 45-degree angle. Pinch off some of the bread inside to make room for the filling.'),
('805e007d-6d18-443a-80c7-1deed9c26d75', 'ko', 'Place rolls on the prepared baking tray. Hollow out the top of each roll by cutting in at a 45-degree angle. Pinch off some of the bread inside to make room for the filling.'),
('17196c49-a19c-4108-81b1-a27553bd955f', 'en', 'Slice steaks into thin strips, then across into 1/2-inch pieces. Transfer to a mixing bowl. Add sautéed onions and accumulated meat juices. Toss in 1 ½ cups provolone, pickled peppers, cream cheese, 1 teaspoon kosher salt, and 1/4 teaspoon black pepper; mix until thoroughly combined. Taste and season with salt if needed. Spoon filling into rolls and top with remaining 1 cup provolone cheese.'),
('17196c49-a19c-4108-81b1-a27553bd955f', 'ko', 'Slice steaks into thin strips, then across into 1/2-inch pieces. Transfer to a mixing bowl. Add sautéed onions and accumulated meat juices. Toss in 1 ½ cups provolone, pickled peppers, cream cheese, 1 teaspoon kosher salt, and 1/4 teaspoon black pepper; mix until thoroughly combined. Taste and season with salt if needed. Spoon filling into rolls and top with remaining 1 cup provolone cheese.'),
('7af0d447-1767-4704-8e2c-18df9d692267', 'en', 'Bake in the preheated oven until cheese is melted and the edges of rolls start to brown, about 15 minutes.'),
('7af0d447-1767-4704-8e2c-18df9d692267', 'ko', 'Bake in the preheated oven until cheese is melted and the edges of rolls start to brown, about 15 minutes.'),
('fd76e3cb-e623-466f-8f45-43073159f64a', 'en', 'Add olive oil to a saucepan set over medium-high heat; add butter, and heat until melted. Toss in sage leaves and fry until they are dark green and have stopped bubbling, 20 to 30 seconds. Turn off the heat; remove sage leaves to a paper towel-lined plate and set aside. Fried sage leaves can be stored in the refrigerator and used to garnish the tops later.'),
('fd76e3cb-e623-466f-8f45-43073159f64a', 'ko', 'Add olive oil to a saucepan set over medium-high heat; add butter, and heat until melted. Toss in sage leaves and fry until they are dark green and have stopped bubbling, 20 to 30 seconds. Turn off the heat; remove sage leaves to a paper towel-lined plate and set aside. Fried sage leaves can be stored in the refrigerator and used to garnish the tops later.'),
('6408e1fe-f1f3-45ce-8cf2-a54f2c0128a3', 'en', 'Add pumpkin to the pan, pour in water, and turn heat to high. Whisk and bring to a boil. Season with salt and pepper.'),
('6408e1fe-f1f3-45ce-8cf2-a54f2c0128a3', 'ko', 'Add pumpkin to the pan, pour in water, and turn heat to high. Whisk and bring to a boil. Season with salt and pepper.'),
('5661de9d-c4b7-45c1-8d2b-3d26e2eee219', 'en', 'With mixture boiling, slowly sprinkle in cornmeal, whisking constantly. Reduce heat to medium-low, and cook, stirring occasionally, until cornmeal is creamy, soft, and no longer gritty, about 25 minutes.'),
('5661de9d-c4b7-45c1-8d2b-3d26e2eee219', 'ko', 'With mixture boiling, slowly sprinkle in cornmeal, whisking constantly. Reduce heat to medium-low, and cook, stirring occasionally, until cornmeal is creamy, soft, and no longer gritty, about 25 minutes.'),
('4798343b-91ee-475e-813d-8722c41d6373', 'en', 'Turn off heat; add cayenne, milk, and Parmigiano Reggiano cheese. Whisk thoroughly until evenly combined.'),
('4798343b-91ee-475e-813d-8722c41d6373', 'ko', 'Turn off heat; add cayenne, milk, and Parmigiano Reggiano cheese. Whisk thoroughly until evenly combined.'),
('c7a681be-4131-47a6-817d-ea9aa235a2c9', 'en', 'Generously grease a 9x9-inch cake pan with olive oil; spread polenta evenly into the pan. Let cool to room temperature. Wrap and chill in the refrigerator for at least 3 hours.'),
('c7a681be-4131-47a6-817d-ea9aa235a2c9', 'ko', 'Generously grease a 9x9-inch cake pan with olive oil; spread polenta evenly into the pan. Let cool to room temperature. Wrap and chill in the refrigerator for at least 3 hours.'),
('bd437db7-9a78-4b83-8dc6-778f1b447352', 'en', 'Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Invert cold, firm polenta onto a cutting board and cut into 8 equal portions.'),
('bd437db7-9a78-4b83-8dc6-778f1b447352', 'ko', 'Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Invert cold, firm polenta onto a cutting board and cut into 8 equal portions.'),
('21fa37ab-b250-4a26-8241-7f67180f2d93', 'en', 'Transfer to a lined baking sheet, and top each piece with grated Monterey Jack cheese. Sprinkle tops with paprika or cayenne, if desired.'),
('21fa37ab-b250-4a26-8241-7f67180f2d93', 'ko', 'Transfer to a lined baking sheet, and top each piece with grated Monterey Jack cheese. Sprinkle tops with paprika or cayenne, if desired.'),
('5d5f3085-d0c5-4c55-80d6-95897e247550', 'en', 'Bake in the preheated oven until polenta is heated through, and the edges are turning golden-brown, about 30 minutes. Garnish tops with fried sage and serve.'),
('5d5f3085-d0c5-4c55-80d6-95897e247550', 'ko', 'Bake in the preheated oven until polenta is heated through, and the edges are turning golden-brown, about 30 minutes. Garnish tops with fried sage and serve.'),
('d3c92daf-3934-4dd3-8e33-77aca681aa70', 'en', 'For the marinade: Mix wine, sliced onions, carrots, brandy, garlic, peppercorns, salt, parsley, and bay leaf in a large glass or ceramic bowl. Add beef and toss to evenly coat; cover the bowl with plastic wrap and marinate in the refrigerator for 2 days.'),
('d3c92daf-3934-4dd3-8e33-77aca681aa70', 'ko', 'For the marinade: Mix wine, sliced onions, carrots, brandy, garlic, peppercorns, salt, parsley, and bay leaf in a large glass or ceramic bowl. Add beef and toss to evenly coat; cover the bowl with plastic wrap and marinate in the refrigerator for 2 days.'),
('46218ffc-8fa5-49b8-8372-8d8ed3ecde7f', 'en', 'For the bourguignon: Preheat the oven to 300 degrees F (150 degrees C).'),
('46218ffc-8fa5-49b8-8372-8d8ed3ecde7f', 'ko', 'For the bourguignon: Preheat the oven to 300 degrees F (150 degrees C).'),
('1a87d115-e038-405c-826d-b6f592e084fa', 'en', 'Strain beef from the marinade and shake off excess; pat dry with paper towels. Strain vegetables and set aside; reserve marinade. Heat 2 tablespoons of oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Add beef in batches; cook until browned on all sides. Transfer browned beef into a separate medium bowl; set aside.'),
('1a87d115-e038-405c-826d-b6f592e084fa', 'ko', 'Strain beef from the marinade and shake off excess; pat dry with paper towels. Strain vegetables and set aside; reserve marinade. Heat 2 tablespoons of oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Add beef in batches; cook until browned on all sides. Transfer browned beef into a separate medium bowl; set aside.'),
('120b3506-dff1-4691-8baf-54a6864e18a5', 'en', 'Add bacon to the same skillet; cook and stir until lightly browned. Transfer bacon to the bowl with browned beef. Drain the skillet and return it to the heat. Pour 1 cup of reserved marinade into the skillet; bring to a boil while scraping the browned bits of food off the bottom of the pan with a wooden spoon. Return this liquid to the reserved marinade.'),
('120b3506-dff1-4691-8baf-54a6864e18a5', 'ko', 'Add bacon to the same skillet; cook and stir until lightly browned. Transfer bacon to the bowl with browned beef. Drain the skillet and return it to the heat. Pour 1 cup of reserved marinade into the skillet; bring to a boil while scraping the browned bits of food off the bottom of the pan with a wooden spoon. Return this liquid to the reserved marinade.'),
('c01d825c-4c4e-4c6a-8b70-38c3ea2e48f1', 'en', 'Heat remaining 2 tablespoons oil in the same skillet. Add chopped onions; cook and stir until just tender, about 2 to 3 minutes. Stir in reserved onions and carrots from the marinade; mix well, then use a slotted spoon to transfer vegetables into the bowl with beef.'),
('c01d825c-4c4e-4c6a-8b70-38c3ea2e48f1', 'ko', 'Heat remaining 2 tablespoons oil in the same skillet. Add chopped onions; cook and stir until just tender, about 2 to 3 minutes. Stir in reserved onions and carrots from the marinade; mix well, then use a slotted spoon to transfer vegetables into the bowl with beef.'),
('32cb98e0-4c71-458e-8551-ca3ba426b305', 'en', 'Return the skillet to the heat; stir flour in pan drippings until browned, about 1 or 2 minutes. Stir in garlic and tomato paste until combined. Add beef broth, remaining reserved marinade, salt, and pepper. Bring to a boil, whisking to remove any flour lumps; pour over beef mixture in the bowl. Transfer beef mixture into a casserole or baking dish.'),
('32cb98e0-4c71-458e-8551-ca3ba426b305', 'ko', 'Return the skillet to the heat; stir flour in pan drippings until browned, about 1 or 2 minutes. Stir in garlic and tomato paste until combined. Add beef broth, remaining reserved marinade, salt, and pepper. Bring to a boil, whisking to remove any flour lumps; pour over beef mixture in the bowl. Transfer beef mixture into a casserole or baking dish.'),
('024cfbb4-deb8-465e-8f37-84243c6f0f62', 'en', 'Cook in the preheated oven until beef is tender, about 3 hours; stir occasionally and add water if needed.'),
('024cfbb4-deb8-465e-8f37-84243c6f0f62', 'ko', 'Cook in the preheated oven until beef is tender, about 3 hours; stir occasionally and add water if needed.'),
('d27e39aa-b085-46c2-821e-227050b5dd63', 'en', 'About 10 minutes before serving, melt butter in a skillet over medium-high heat. Add mushrooms and sauté until lightly browned, about 5 to 7 minutes; stir mushrooms into beef mixture until well combined.'),
('d27e39aa-b085-46c2-821e-227050b5dd63', 'ko', 'About 10 minutes before serving, melt butter in a skillet over medium-high heat. Add mushrooms and sauté until lightly browned, about 5 to 7 minutes; stir mushrooms into beef mixture until well combined.'),
('07567627-f757-45a2-8cec-a5ab3b64c324', 'en', 'Gather all ingredients.'),
('07567627-f757-45a2-8cec-a5ab3b64c324', 'ko', 'Gather all ingredients.'),
('02624faa-65fd-443c-8f37-ac1e747b115d', 'en', 'Make broth: Place beef bones in a 9-quart (or larger) pot; season with 1 teaspoon salt. Pour water into the pot and bring to a boil. Reduce heat and simmer broth for about 2 hours.'),
('02624faa-65fd-443c-8f37-ac1e747b115d', 'ko', 'Make broth: Place beef bones in a 9-quart (or larger) pot; season with 1 teaspoon salt. Pour water into the pot and bring to a boil. Reduce heat and simmer broth for about 2 hours.'),
('81550103-dd55-40d6-8556-ca85eabdcf56', 'en', 'Meanwhile, set an oven rack about 6 inches from the heat source and preheat the oven''s broiler. Line a 10x15-inch roasting pan with aluminum foil.'),
('81550103-dd55-40d6-8556-ca85eabdcf56', 'ko', 'Meanwhile, set an oven rack about 6 inches from the heat source and preheat the oven''s broiler. Line a 10x15-inch roasting pan with aluminum foil.'),
('8418d2ca-f53f-473a-8509-3992ef6be512', 'en', 'Place onions and unpeeled ginger onto the prepared roasting pan and cook under the preheated broiler, stirring occasionally, until vegetables are charred, 10 to 15 minutes.'),
('8418d2ca-f53f-473a-8509-3992ef6be512', 'ko', 'Place onions and unpeeled ginger onto the prepared roasting pan and cook under the preheated broiler, stirring occasionally, until vegetables are charred, 10 to 15 minutes.'),
('b1f7fb5d-bc5d-4fa5-869c-d9754ebc7ba8', 'en', 'Cool slightly. Chop onions, then peel and slice ginger; set aside separately.'),
('b1f7fb5d-bc5d-4fa5-869c-d9754ebc7ba8', 'ko', 'Cool slightly. Chop onions, then peel and slice ginger; set aside separately.'),
('afb55809-d7f0-470d-8a7f-0a2354c0d7be', 'en', 'Skim fat from surface of simmering broth. Add oxtail, radish, and charred onions to broth. Tie charred ginger, anise, cinnamon stick, peppercorns, and cloves in cheesecloth to make a bouquet garni; add to broth. Stir in sugar, fish sauce, and remaining 2 teaspoons salt. Simmer over medium-low heat for at least 4 hours (the longer, the better). Season with salt.'),
('afb55809-d7f0-470d-8a7f-0a2354c0d7be', 'ko', 'Skim fat from surface of simmering broth. Add oxtail, radish, and charred onions to broth. Tie charred ginger, anise, cinnamon stick, peppercorns, and cloves in cheesecloth to make a bouquet garni; add to broth. Stir in sugar, fish sauce, and remaining 2 teaspoons salt. Simmer over medium-low heat for at least 4 hours (the longer, the better). Season with salt.'),
('815fd231-aded-4048-86b8-7aa721c7318d', 'en', 'Strain broth. Discard bones and bouquet garni. Reserve meat from bones for another use. Chill broth in the refrigerator, 8 hours to overnight.'),
('815fd231-aded-4048-86b8-7aa721c7318d', 'ko', 'Strain broth. Discard bones and bouquet garni. Reserve meat from bones for another use. Chill broth in the refrigerator, 8 hours to overnight.'),
('9023c6a3-bac5-4da7-8cb1-57e10f7cd202', 'en', 'Skim and discard fat from the top of chilled broth. Pour broth into a pot; bring to a boil. Reduce heat and keep hot until ready to serve.'),
('9023c6a3-bac5-4da7-8cb1-57e10f7cd202', 'ko', 'Skim and discard fat from the top of chilled broth. Pour broth into a pot; bring to a boil. Reduce heat and keep hot until ready to serve.'),
('5879d574-de7f-4d07-825c-4f62c8f80063', 'en', 'Bring a pot of water to a boil. Turn off heat. Stir in rice noodles and let sit until noodles are tender yet chewy, 6 to 10 minutes.'),
('5879d574-de7f-4d07-825c-4f62c8f80063', 'ko', 'Bring a pot of water to a boil. Turn off heat. Stir in rice noodles and let sit until noodles are tender yet chewy, 6 to 10 minutes.'),
('8ad5e9c1-c5a8-4c1a-85aa-0d10bc2bb975', 'en', 'Meanwhile, cut frozen sirloin into paper-thin slices.'),
('8ad5e9c1-c5a8-4c1a-85aa-0d10bc2bb975', 'ko', 'Meanwhile, cut frozen sirloin into paper-thin slices.'),
('f7b2f32d-21de-477a-8ed1-958c1198e1e4', 'en', 'Drain and divide noodles among bowls, about 1 1/2 cups per serving. Top each with a few sirloin slices. Ladle hot broth over sirloin and noodles.'),
('f7b2f32d-21de-477a-8ed1-958c1198e1e4', 'ko', 'Drain and divide noodles among bowls, about 1 1/2 cups per serving. Top each with a few sirloin slices. Ladle hot broth over sirloin and noodles.'),
('86a2019a-7080-4276-899b-730dcc21d6bf', 'en', 'Serve and enjoy!'),
('86a2019a-7080-4276-899b-730dcc21d6bf', 'ko', 'Serve and enjoy!'),
('ed52b449-cc99-407a-8b4d-7f62c298289d', 'en', 'Preheat oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). In 9 inch pie pan, toss shallots with oil to coat. Season with salt and pepper. Roast until shallots are deep brown and very tender, stirring occasionally, about 30 minutes.'),
('ed52b449-cc99-407a-8b4d-7f62c298289d', 'ko', 'Preheat oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). In 9 inch pie pan, toss shallots with oil to coat. Season with salt and pepper. Roast until shallots are deep brown and very tender, stirring occasionally, about 30 minutes.'),
('b4abdde7-4944-4fc3-8b2c-129f7699ce7d', 'en', 'In a large saucepan, combine beef broth and port. Bring to a boil. Cook over high heat until the volume is reduced by half, about 30 minutes. Whisk in tomato paste. Set aside.'),
('b4abdde7-4944-4fc3-8b2c-129f7699ce7d', 'ko', 'In a large saucepan, combine beef broth and port. Bring to a boil. Cook over high heat until the volume is reduced by half, about 30 minutes. Whisk in tomato paste. Set aside.'),
('b5795bc9-cb30-4864-847e-e7705329ae1e', 'en', 'Pat beef dry; sprinkle with thyme, salt and pepper. In a large roasting pan, set over medium heat on the stove top, saute bacon until golden. Using a slotted spoon, transfer bacon to paper towels. Add beef to pan; brown on all sides over medium high heat, about 7 minutes.'),
('b5795bc9-cb30-4864-847e-e7705329ae1e', 'ko', 'Pat beef dry; sprinkle with thyme, salt and pepper. In a large roasting pan, set over medium heat on the stove top, saute bacon until golden. Using a slotted spoon, transfer bacon to paper towels. Add beef to pan; brown on all sides over medium high heat, about 7 minutes.'),
('09188b6d-bc41-4c14-85f6-b9a480aa1fe4', 'en', 'Transfer pan to oven. Roast beef until meat thermometer inserted into center registers 125 degrees F (50 degrees C) for medium rare, about 25 minutes. Transfer beef to platter. Tent loosely with foil.'),
('09188b6d-bc41-4c14-85f6-b9a480aa1fe4', 'ko', 'Transfer pan to oven. Roast beef until meat thermometer inserted into center registers 125 degrees F (50 degrees C) for medium rare, about 25 minutes. Transfer beef to platter. Tent loosely with foil.'),
('4a41d496-e67c-4f90-8f6d-1d049a7a694f', 'en', 'Spoon fat off top of pan drippings in roasting pan. Place pan over high heat on stove top. Add broth mixture, and bring to boil; stir to scrape up any browned bits. Transfer to a medium saucepan, and bring to simmer. Mix 1 1/2 tablespoon butter and flour in small bowl to form smooth paste; whisk into broth mixture, and simmer until sauce thickens. Whisk in remaining butter. Stir in roasted shallots and reserved bacon. Season with salt and pepper.'),
('4a41d496-e67c-4f90-8f6d-1d049a7a694f', 'ko', 'Spoon fat off top of pan drippings in roasting pan. Place pan over high heat on stove top. Add broth mixture, and bring to boil; stir to scrape up any browned bits. Transfer to a medium saucepan, and bring to simmer. Mix 1 1/2 tablespoon butter and flour in small bowl to form smooth paste; whisk into broth mixture, and simmer until sauce thickens. Whisk in remaining butter. Stir in roasted shallots and reserved bacon. Season with salt and pepper.'),
('f51eeb31-a2cf-4586-89a0-bc3788b2acad', 'en', 'Cut beef into 1/2 inch thick slices. Spoon some sauce over, and garnish with watercress.'),
('f51eeb31-a2cf-4586-89a0-bc3788b2acad', 'ko', 'Cut beef into 1/2 inch thick slices. Spoon some sauce over, and garnish with watercress.'),
('99a7b1c9-7855-455a-8f71-03b7c188e3ad', 'en', 'Wash and dry beets and greens. Shred greens to measure 2 cups and set aside.'),
('99a7b1c9-7855-455a-8f71-03b7c188e3ad', 'ko', 'Wash and dry beets and greens. Shred greens to measure 2 cups and set aside.'),
('172b47f3-929f-4561-8470-06e521ab3967', 'en', 'Place beets in a sauce pan with enough water to cover. Bring to a boil, cover, reduce heat and simmer for 20 minutes or until tender. Drain and allow to cool.'),
('172b47f3-929f-4561-8470-06e521ab3967', 'ko', 'Place beets in a sauce pan with enough water to cover. Bring to a boil, cover, reduce heat and simmer for 20 minutes or until tender. Drain and allow to cool.'),
('50725297-9ebe-4b24-82b4-735cb013d42a', 'en', 'Trim and peel skins off beets; cut into 8 wedges.'),
('50725297-9ebe-4b24-82b4-735cb013d42a', 'ko', 'Trim and peel skins off beets; cut into 8 wedges.'),
('0bb1494b-9cf1-4473-8e6b-a48d67e6b9a2', 'en', 'Combine orange sections, beets, and apples in a bowl.'),
('0bb1494b-9cf1-4473-8e6b-a48d67e6b9a2', 'ko', 'Combine orange sections, beets, and apples in a bowl.'),
('070c610e-a9f2-4820-856c-16bed36d9a6a', 'en', 'Whisk olive oil, vinegar, sugar, salt and garlic together in a bowl; pour over beet mixture and toss well.'),
('070c610e-a9f2-4820-856c-16bed36d9a6a', 'ko', 'Whisk olive oil, vinegar, sugar, salt and garlic together in a bowl; pour over beet mixture and toss well.'),
('b23a9598-923c-4934-839f-cd48c261e775', 'en', 'Arrange 1/2 cup beet greens on 4 salad plates. Top with beet mixture, sprinkle with sunflower seeds and serve.'),
('b23a9598-923c-4934-839f-cd48c261e775', 'ko', 'Arrange 1/2 cup beet greens on 4 salad plates. Top with beet mixture, sprinkle with sunflower seeds and serve.'),
('72a1f9b4-e327-45e4-8eb7-b1971d56f369', 'en', 'Place butter in a light-colored saucepan over medium heat. Cook, swirling the pan constantly, until butter is bubbling, smells nutty, and browned bits begin to form on the bottom of the pan, 5 to 10 minutes. Immediately remove from heat and pour butter into a heat-safe bowl. Allow brown butter to cool to room temperature, about 15 minutes.'),
('72a1f9b4-e327-45e4-8eb7-b1971d56f369', 'ko', 'Place butter in a light-colored saucepan over medium heat. Cook, swirling the pan constantly, until butter is bubbling, smells nutty, and browned bits begin to form on the bottom of the pan, 5 to 10 minutes. Immediately remove from heat and pour butter into a heat-safe bowl. Allow brown butter to cool to room temperature, about 15 minutes.'),
('e42e2bfb-ee26-43c2-880f-309ede51dd1f', 'en', 'Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C). Grease a 12x16-inch pan and line with parchment paper.'),
('e42e2bfb-ee26-43c2-880f-309ede51dd1f', 'ko', 'Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C). Grease a 12x16-inch pan and line with parchment paper.'),
('7215ea12-0aa7-4040-8936-e7cf3336e958', 'en', 'Whisk flour, baking soda, baking powder, cinnamon, allspice, nutmeg, and salt together in a bowl until well combined.'),
('7215ea12-0aa7-4040-8936-e7cf3336e958', 'ko', 'Whisk flour, baking soda, baking powder, cinnamon, allspice, nutmeg, and salt together in a bowl until well combined.'),
('ddda2607-e729-4766-8f9f-51d285dd8da7', 'en', 'Beat cooled brown butter and brown sugar in a large bowl with an electric mixer on medium speed until well combined. Beat in eggs, one at a time, mixing well after each addition, until mixture is light and fluffy. Mix in vanilla. Pour in 1/2 of the flour mixture and mix until just combined. Add in remaining flour mixture and mix until just combined.'),
('ddda2607-e729-4766-8f9f-51d285dd8da7', 'ko', 'Beat cooled brown butter and brown sugar in a large bowl with an electric mixer on medium speed until well combined. Beat in eggs, one at a time, mixing well after each addition, until mixture is light and fluffy. Mix in vanilla. Pour in 1/2 of the flour mixture and mix until just combined. Add in remaining flour mixture and mix until just combined.'),
('c0c1db8d-fd6e-4fcb-8dbb-caf3b0fd22b7', 'en', 'Fold in shredded carrots, walnuts, and raisins. Pour batter into the prepared pan and smooth out the top with a spatula.'),
('c0c1db8d-fd6e-4fcb-8dbb-caf3b0fd22b7', 'ko', 'Fold in shredded carrots, walnuts, and raisins. Pour batter into the prepared pan and smooth out the top with a spatula.'),
('a1db18c7-735c-475b-86cf-f08b3acbeb7d', 'en', 'Bake in the preheated oven until cake is golden and a toothpick inserted into the center of it comes out clean, 23 to 27 minutes. Transfer onto a wire rack and cool completely, about 30 minutes.'),
('a1db18c7-735c-475b-86cf-f08b3acbeb7d', 'ko', 'Bake in the preheated oven until cake is golden and a toothpick inserted into the center of it comes out clean, 23 to 27 minutes. Transfer onto a wire rack and cool completely, about 30 minutes.'),
('d8bccec6-b54b-46fe-8935-259b6787a27b', 'en', 'While cake is cooling, repeat step 1 to brown butter for the frosting. Let cool to room temperature, about 15 minutes.'),
('d8bccec6-b54b-46fe-8935-259b6787a27b', 'ko', 'While cake is cooling, repeat step 1 to brown butter for the frosting. Let cool to room temperature, about 15 minutes.'),
('7843b9bd-d963-4d92-81a2-4fa27258be0c', 'en', 'Beat cream cheese in a large bowl with an electric mixer on medium-high speed until completely smooth. Add in cooled brown butter and mix until thoroughly combined. Mix in powdered sugar, 1 cup at a time, beating well after each addition. Mix in vanilla and salt. Beat frosting at medium-high speed until completely smooth, 1 to 2 minutes.'),
('7843b9bd-d963-4d92-81a2-4fa27258be0c', 'ko', 'Beat cream cheese in a large bowl with an electric mixer on medium-high speed until completely smooth. Add in cooled brown butter and mix until thoroughly combined. Mix in powdered sugar, 1 cup at a time, beating well after each addition. Mix in vanilla and salt. Beat frosting at medium-high speed until completely smooth, 1 to 2 minutes.'),
('f98b4558-909a-479f-8051-6ff2ba4914b4', 'en', 'Spread frosting over the cooled cake. Chill cake until ready to serve.'),
('f98b4558-909a-479f-8051-6ff2ba4914b4', 'ko', 'Spread frosting over the cooled cake. Chill cake until ready to serve.'),
('4c6df3b6-853b-44b6-84e0-faaeff3b571e', 'en', 'Place a chicken breast on a flat work surface. Slice horizontally through the middle, being careful not to cut all the way through to the other side. Open the 2 sides and spread them out like an open book. Repeat with remaining chicken breasts. Add chicken and vinaigrette to a resealable plastic bag; seal the bag and place in the refrigerator to marinate overnight.'),
('4c6df3b6-853b-44b6-84e0-faaeff3b571e', 'ko', 'Place a chicken breast on a flat work surface. Slice horizontally through the middle, being careful not to cut all the way through to the other side. Open the 2 sides and spread them out like an open book. Repeat with remaining chicken breasts. Add chicken and vinaigrette to a resealable plastic bag; seal the bag and place in the refrigerator to marinate overnight.'),
('ae0a8fb3-ab79-418a-823f-9a478142317a', 'en', 'Preheat an outdoor grill to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).'),
('ae0a8fb3-ab79-418a-823f-9a478142317a', 'ko', 'Preheat an outdoor grill to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).'),
('089b464c-36b1-4f2d-87c8-3a3d9748a370', 'en', 'Discard vinaigrette, and place chicken on the grill. Grill for 4 to 5 minutes. Turn chicken breast over with tongs. Continue to cook until juices no longer run pink, and an instant-read thermometer reads 165 degrees F (74 degrees C), 4 to 5 minutes more.'),
('089b464c-36b1-4f2d-87c8-3a3d9748a370', 'ko', 'Discard vinaigrette, and place chicken on the grill. Grill for 4 to 5 minutes. Turn chicken breast over with tongs. Continue to cook until juices no longer run pink, and an instant-read thermometer reads 165 degrees F (74 degrees C), 4 to 5 minutes more.'),
('94e1099f-99e8-4c09-81e2-b2641e082256', 'en', 'Meanwhile, bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Cook fusilli in the boiling water, stirring occasionally, until tender yet firm to the bite, about 12 minutes. Drain pasta and immediately submerge pasta in an ice water bath.'),
('94e1099f-99e8-4c09-81e2-b2641e082256', 'ko', 'Meanwhile, bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Cook fusilli in the boiling water, stirring occasionally, until tender yet firm to the bite, about 12 minutes. Drain pasta and immediately submerge pasta in an ice water bath.'),
('a70713f6-fd49-4ba8-8e61-feb0f1dafdd9', 'en', 'Cut tomatoes in half and place in a bowl. Add oil, minced garlic, and basil. Season to taste with salt and pepper.'),
('a70713f6-fd49-4ba8-8e61-feb0f1dafdd9', 'ko', 'Cut tomatoes in half and place in a bowl. Add oil, minced garlic, and basil. Season to taste with salt and pepper.'),
('ae47de0c-8a27-45dd-8c5b-e0b2e46a3125', 'en', 'Drain pasta again; add to tomato mixture. Lightly toss to distribute tomatoes and combine. Top with grilled chicken breast, and drizzle with balsamic glaze.'),
('ae47de0c-8a27-45dd-8c5b-e0b2e46a3125', 'ko', 'Drain pasta again; add to tomato mixture. Lightly toss to distribute tomatoes and combine. Top with grilled chicken breast, and drizzle with balsamic glaze.'),
('eed6b044-174a-474f-88cb-619d94c6020b', 'en', 'Heat a dry saucepan over high heat. Place thighs skin-side down in the hot pan and cook until skin is browned, seasoning generously with salt, about 5 minutes. Turn thighs over once skin no longer sticks to the pan. Add butter, Louisiana hot sauce, and water. Toss thighs around to stir the sauce until butter is melted.'),
('eed6b044-174a-474f-88cb-619d94c6020b', 'ko', 'Heat a dry saucepan over high heat. Place thighs skin-side down in the hot pan and cook until skin is browned, seasoning generously with salt, about 5 minutes. Turn thighs over once skin no longer sticks to the pan. Add butter, Louisiana hot sauce, and water. Toss thighs around to stir the sauce until butter is melted.'),
('ba9211e1-d0f1-499b-8b08-e517acfde72e', 'en', 'Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer until meat can be easily pulled from the bone, about 1 1/2 hours. Remove from heat and break meat up into smaller pieces using tongs, stirring it into the sauce. Let mixture cool to room temperature, at least 20 minutes.'),
('ba9211e1-d0f1-499b-8b08-e517acfde72e', 'ko', 'Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer until meat can be easily pulled from the bone, about 1 1/2 hours. Remove from heat and break meat up into smaller pieces using tongs, stirring it into the sauce. Let mixture cool to room temperature, at least 20 minutes.'),
('5a9df391-5b2d-4054-83ad-33d69c4bf305', 'en', 'Transfer meat to a mixing bowl, shredding it into smaller pieces. Discard bones, cartilage, and skin.'),
('5a9df391-5b2d-4054-83ad-33d69c4bf305', 'ko', 'Transfer meat to a mixing bowl, shredding it into smaller pieces. Discard bones, cartilage, and skin.'),
('ae1e7160-84a4-4c0b-8fbe-c44c686b2959', 'en', 'Bring the sauce in the pan to a boil over medium-high heat. Let reduce until slightly thickened, about 2 minutes. Pour sauce into the bowl of chicken meat and mix thoroughly. Taste for seasoning; add salt, cayenne, and hot sauce as needed. Add celery and mix one last time.'),
('ae1e7160-84a4-4c0b-8fbe-c44c686b2959', 'ko', 'Bring the sauce in the pan to a boil over medium-high heat. Let reduce until slightly thickened, about 2 minutes. Pour sauce into the bowl of chicken meat and mix thoroughly. Taste for seasoning; add salt, cayenne, and hot sauce as needed. Add celery and mix one last time.'),
('73c93bd2-5f63-458b-85be-6cc2c1419a61', 'en', 'Pack chicken mixture into a pint-sized jar or crock, and top with a spoonful of hot sauce if desired, and seal jar. Refrigerate until ready to serve. Remove from fridge 30 minutes before service to allow spread to warm up a bit.'),
('73c93bd2-5f63-458b-85be-6cc2c1419a61', 'ko', 'Pack chicken mixture into a pint-sized jar or crock, and top with a spoonful of hot sauce if desired, and seal jar. Refrigerate until ready to serve. Remove from fridge 30 minutes before service to allow spread to warm up a bit.'),
('097ef8f6-7e17-418d-8a7d-34b1153558cd', 'en', 'Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C) in the meantime. Arrange baguette slices on a baking sheet. Brush tops generously with butter.'),
('097ef8f6-7e17-418d-8a7d-34b1153558cd', 'ko', 'Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C) in the meantime. Arrange baguette slices on a baking sheet. Brush tops generously with butter.'),
('92bd44ed-b78a-4d76-8f2a-f5e9de2ff453', 'en', 'Bake in the preheated oven until edges start to turn golden brown, about 20 minutes.'),
('92bd44ed-b78a-4d76-8f2a-f5e9de2ff453', 'ko', 'Bake in the preheated oven until edges start to turn golden brown, about 20 minutes.'),
('e1c77e44-6a6f-48c7-8e88-323bcea2bb16', 'en', 'Meanwhile, smear butter and blue cheese together in a small bowl until combined.'),
('e1c77e44-6a6f-48c7-8e88-323bcea2bb16', 'ko', 'Meanwhile, smear butter and blue cheese together in a small bowl until combined.'),
('de51c2b2-1776-4483-8a9a-a8af307d6984', 'en', 'Remove toasted baguette slices and let cool slightly, leaving the oven on. Spread blue cheese spread on top, then continue baking crostini until golden brown and crispy, 10 to 12 minutes. Serve with the Buffalo chicken spread.'),
('de51c2b2-1776-4483-8a9a-a8af307d6984', 'ko', 'Remove toasted baguette slices and let cool slightly, leaving the oven on. Spread blue cheese spread on top, then continue baking crostini until golden brown and crispy, 10 to 12 minutes. Serve with the Buffalo chicken spread.'),
('ecd8fd4b-7c64-4599-8e70-0e3a47413608', 'en', 'Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Spray a rimmed baking sheet with cooking spray. Spread frozen tater tots in a single layer on prepared pan; drizzle lightly with about 1 tablespoon olive oil; season with about 1 tablespoon barbecue rub.'),
('ecd8fd4b-7c64-4599-8e70-0e3a47413608', 'ko', 'Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Spray a rimmed baking sheet with cooking spray. Spread frozen tater tots in a single layer on prepared pan; drizzle lightly with about 1 tablespoon olive oil; season with about 1 tablespoon barbecue rub.'),
('b20db716-6a34-4de5-8eaf-4937e927b051', 'en', 'Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown and heated through, about 25 minutes, or according to package directions.'),
('b20db716-6a34-4de5-8eaf-4937e927b051', 'ko', 'Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown and heated through, about 25 minutes, or according to package directions.'),
('89a4b34f-7aa4-41ba-8636-4040d41b37e4', 'en', 'Place chicken thighs and remaining 2 tablespoons olive oil in a large bowl. Season liberally with barbeque rub (about 1 tablespoon); toss to coat. Sear chicken in a non-stick skillet over high heat, turning occasionally, until deeply browned; reduce heat to medium.'),
('89a4b34f-7aa4-41ba-8636-4040d41b37e4', 'ko', 'Place chicken thighs and remaining 2 tablespoons olive oil in a large bowl. Season liberally with barbeque rub (about 1 tablespoon); toss to coat. Sear chicken in a non-stick skillet over high heat, turning occasionally, until deeply browned; reduce heat to medium.'),
('0a9da42c-6338-4f0c-8cda-382824efa409', 'en', 'Meanwhile, melt butter in a small saucepan over medium-low heat; stir in hot sauce, hot honey, and season to taste with barbecue rub; bring to a simmer.'),
('0a9da42c-6338-4f0c-8cda-382824efa409', 'ko', 'Meanwhile, melt butter in a small saucepan over medium-low heat; stir in hot sauce, hot honey, and season to taste with barbecue rub; bring to a simmer.'),
('7cc21b4d-c58c-4bfb-853d-e674d3aab49c', 'en', 'Pour honey hot sauce over chicken in the skillet; increase heat to medium-high and cook chicken, basting constantly with the sauce, until chicken is fully cooked and coated with a shiny glaze, about 5 minutes. Chicken juices should run clear, and an instant-read thermometer inserted near the center should reach 165 degrees F (74 degrees C). Remove chicken to a cutting board; slice chicken into bite-sized pieces.'),
('7cc21b4d-c58c-4bfb-853d-e674d3aab49c', 'ko', 'Pour honey hot sauce over chicken in the skillet; increase heat to medium-high and cook chicken, basting constantly with the sauce, until chicken is fully cooked and coated with a shiny glaze, about 5 minutes. Chicken juices should run clear, and an instant-read thermometer inserted near the center should reach 165 degrees F (74 degrees C). Remove chicken to a cutting board; slice chicken into bite-sized pieces.'),
('5af261dc-a474-44b7-8b64-a57a09edec3b', 'en', 'Warm cheese sauce in the microwave on 50% power until hot, about 1 minute, stirring every 30 seconds.'),
('5af261dc-a474-44b7-8b64-a57a09edec3b', 'ko', 'Warm cheese sauce in the microwave on 50% power until hot, about 1 minute, stirring every 30 seconds.'),
('85df3e31-5088-447d-853e-e9e6dd5729cb', 'en', 'Arrange tater tots on a serving platter (or assemble on the sheet pan). Top tots with chicken and any remaining sauce from the pan; sprinkle with shredded cheese. Use a kitchen torch to melt cheese. Drizzle on additional hot sauce to taste and queso blanco; garnish with pickled red onion and parsley.'),
('85df3e31-5088-447d-853e-e9e6dd5729cb', 'ko', 'Arrange tater tots on a serving platter (or assemble on the sheet pan). Top tots with chicken and any remaining sauce from the pan; sprinkle with shredded cheese. Use a kitchen torch to melt cheese. Drizzle on additional hot sauce to taste and queso blanco; garnish with pickled red onion and parsley.'),
('1aa9d480-1c16-4b6f-87e0-bede937e14c5', 'en', 'Place the eggs into a saucepan in a single layer and fill with water to cover the eggs by 1 inch. Cover the saucepan and bring the water to a boil over high heat. Once the water is boiling, remove from the heat and let the eggs stand in the hot water for 15 minutes. Pour out the hot water, then cool the eggs under cold running water in the sink. Peel once cold.'),
('1aa9d480-1c16-4b6f-87e0-bede937e14c5', 'ko', 'Place the eggs into a saucepan in a single layer and fill with water to cover the eggs by 1 inch. Cover the saucepan and bring the water to a boil over high heat. Once the water is boiling, remove from the heat and let the eggs stand in the hot water for 15 minutes. Pour out the hot water, then cool the eggs under cold running water in the sink. Peel once cold.'),
('6dad0a96-be32-484c-80c7-40cb84ba48af', 'en', 'Preheat the oven''s broiler and set the oven rack about 6 inches from the heat source.'),
('6dad0a96-be32-484c-80c7-40cb84ba48af', 'ko', 'Preheat the oven''s broiler and set the oven rack about 6 inches from the heat source.'),
('af98091a-8faf-4e86-8610-b2016508a806', 'en', 'Coat beef and chicken livers with 2 tablespoons of corn oil, then spread livers on a baking sheet. Broil in the preheated oven until brown on the top, 8 to 10 minutes. Flip the livers and continue to broil until the livers are no longer pink in the center and juices run clear, about 5 minutes. Place livers in a bowl and chill in the refrigerator.'),
('af98091a-8faf-4e86-8610-b2016508a806', 'ko', 'Coat beef and chicken livers with 2 tablespoons of corn oil, then spread livers on a baking sheet. Broil in the preheated oven until brown on the top, 8 to 10 minutes. Flip the livers and continue to broil until the livers are no longer pink in the center and juices run clear, about 5 minutes. Place livers in a bowl and chill in the refrigerator.'),
('eebe00e3-ceac-4f7e-8143-5ee263da6741', 'en', 'Heat 2 tablespoons of chicken fat and 2 tablespoons corn oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Stir in the onion; cook and stir until the onion has softened and turned translucent, about 10 minutes. Reduce heat to medium-low, and continue cooking and stirring until the onion is very tender and dark brown, 15 to 20 minutes more. Place onion in a bowl; cover and refrigerate until chilled.'),
('eebe00e3-ceac-4f7e-8143-5ee263da6741', 'ko', 'Heat 2 tablespoons of chicken fat and 2 tablespoons corn oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Stir in the onion; cook and stir until the onion has softened and turned translucent, about 10 minutes. Reduce heat to medium-low, and continue cooking and stirring until the onion is very tender and dark brown, 15 to 20 minutes more. Place onion in a bowl; cover and refrigerate until chilled.'),
('86845146-4ddf-4704-8c4d-30cc83247bf8', 'en', 'Finely chop the chilled beef and chicken livers, chilled onions, and hardboiled eggs together, then place in a bowl. Stir in the remaining 1 tablespoon of chicken fat. Season with salt and pepper. Refrigerate until ready to serve.'),
('86845146-4ddf-4704-8c4d-30cc83247bf8', 'ko', 'Finely chop the chilled beef and chicken livers, chilled onions, and hardboiled eggs together, then place in a bowl. Stir in the remaining 1 tablespoon of chicken fat. Season with salt and pepper. Refrigerate until ready to serve.'),
('71341bc7-1c8f-4180-8cae-3ca881e90535', 'en', 'Place potatoes and salt in a medium saucepan and add water to cover by one inch. Place pot over high heat and bring to a boil. Cook until just tender, 8 to 10 minutes. Potatoes should not be soft. Drain and set aside until cool enough to handle.'),
('71341bc7-1c8f-4180-8cae-3ca881e90535', 'ko', 'Place potatoes and salt in a medium saucepan and add water to cover by one inch. Place pot over high heat and bring to a boil. Cook until just tender, 8 to 10 minutes. Potatoes should not be soft. Drain and set aside until cool enough to handle.'),
('019d3936-6a79-4472-8a93-222da3c5b305', 'en', 'Slice potatoes in half across the center and scoop out the center flesh carefully, leaving a 1/8 of an inch border of flesh. Combine sausage and queso in a medium bowl and stir until creamy.'),
('019d3936-6a79-4472-8a93-222da3c5b305', 'ko', 'Slice potatoes in half across the center and scoop out the center flesh carefully, leaving a 1/8 of an inch border of flesh. Combine sausage and queso in a medium bowl and stir until creamy.'),
('9f01e272-44d7-450d-8f93-bc3b50312b7b', 'en', 'Place about 1 teaspoon chorizo mixture in one potato half and place 1 to 2 teaspoons of shredded cheese in the corresponding potato half. Press the two halves together allowing the starch from the potato to hold together as best as possible. Coat each potato in egg, allowing excess todrip, and lightly coat in breadcrumbs, taking care not to allow the potatohalves to separate.'),
('9f01e272-44d7-450d-8f93-bc3b50312b7b', 'ko', 'Place about 1 teaspoon chorizo mixture in one potato half and place 1 to 2 teaspoons of shredded cheese in the corresponding potato half. Press the two halves together allowing the starch from the potato to hold together as best as possible. Coat each potato in egg, allowing excess todrip, and lightly coat in breadcrumbs, taking care not to allow the potatohalves to separate.'),
('8c15cdc4-4acb-4f98-8d65-289d203ba883', 'en', 'Preheat an airfryer to to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Spray potatoes lightly with oil or cooking spray.'),
('8c15cdc4-4acb-4f98-8d65-289d203ba883', 'ko', 'Preheat an airfryer to to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Spray potatoes lightly with oil or cooking spray.'),
('53099f3e-d4d1-47a7-8cb5-b2e4518bf803', 'en', 'Air fry in batches if necessary until golden and crispy, 8 to 10 minutes. Let stand for 5 minutes before serving.'),
('53099f3e-d4d1-47a7-8cb5-b2e4518bf803', 'ko', 'Air fry in batches if necessary until golden and crispy, 8 to 10 minutes. Let stand for 5 minutes before serving.'),
('f8502a1d-d36c-4de2-8826-73acb609d3da', 'en', 'Place potatoes in a large pot and cover with water; bring to a boil. Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer until barely tender, about 8 minutes. Drain. Once cool enough to handle, peel and cut into cubes. Set aside.'),
('f8502a1d-d36c-4de2-8826-73acb609d3da', 'ko', 'Place potatoes in a large pot and cover with water; bring to a boil. Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer until barely tender, about 8 minutes. Drain. Once cool enough to handle, peel and cut into cubes. Set aside.'),
('5ae108aa-2500-4349-8038-974057f183f6', 'en', 'Meanwhile, melt butter in a large skillet and cook onion and green onions until softened, about 5 minutes. Add bell pepper and cook for 3 minutes. Add ground beef; cook and stir until beef is browned, about 5 minutes. Season with paprika, cayenne pepper, and salt.'),
('5ae108aa-2500-4349-8038-974057f183f6', 'ko', 'Meanwhile, melt butter in a large skillet and cook onion and green onions until softened, about 5 minutes. Add bell pepper and cook for 3 minutes. Add ground beef; cook and stir until beef is browned, about 5 minutes. Season with paprika, cayenne pepper, and salt.'),
('0831b158-4104-4744-8a51-15a4d5bf504a', 'en', 'Remove beef mixture from heat; add potatoes and olives. Stir in chopped hard-cooked eggs; set filling aside to cool, about 20 minutes.'),
('0831b158-4104-4744-8a51-15a4d5bf504a', 'ko', 'Remove beef mixture from heat; add potatoes and olives. Stir in chopped hard-cooked eggs; set filling aside to cool, about 20 minutes.'),
('b92fc59c-fb43-454b-8590-94df4fde2f20', 'en', 'Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Line 2 baking sheets with aluminum foil and lightly grease with olive oil.'),
('b92fc59c-fb43-454b-8590-94df4fde2f20', 'ko', 'Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Line 2 baking sheets with aluminum foil and lightly grease with olive oil.'),
('f4ad920f-070b-4656-87a0-95e475307d47', 'en', 'Place an empanada pastry round on a flat surface and lightly wet the edges with warm water. Put a large tablespoon of cooled filling in the center and fold dough over. Seal edges by pressing with a fork. Repeat with remaining rounds and filling. Transfer empanadas to the prepared baking sheets and brush with beaten egg.'),
('f4ad920f-070b-4656-87a0-95e475307d47', 'ko', 'Place an empanada pastry round on a flat surface and lightly wet the edges with warm water. Put a large tablespoon of cooled filling in the center and fold dough over. Seal edges by pressing with a fork. Repeat with remaining rounds and filling. Transfer empanadas to the prepared baking sheets and brush with beaten egg.'),
('a47fa6f3-57ac-48fd-8fc1-c963ac12e8e3', 'en', 'Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown, 15 to 20 minutes.'),
('a47fa6f3-57ac-48fd-8fc1-c963ac12e8e3', 'ko', 'Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown, 15 to 20 minutes.'),
('c778600e-3377-439a-8ca2-ee9313de91c4', 'en', 'Preheat oven to 375 degrees F. Line a rimmed baking sheet with Reynolds Wrap® Aluminum Foil. Set aside. The sheet will catch any spills in the oven later on.'),
('c778600e-3377-439a-8ca2-ee9313de91c4', 'ko', 'Preheat oven to 375 degrees F. Line a rimmed baking sheet with Reynolds Wrap® Aluminum Foil. Set aside. The sheet will catch any spills in the oven later on.'),
('fab502ba-c385-4bfd-8ee7-8986036220d4', 'en', 'Place the potato slices in a large pot and cover with cold water. Season with salt and bring to boil for 5 minutes. Drain in a colander and allow the potatoes to steam for 1 minute.'),
('fab502ba-c385-4bfd-8ee7-8986036220d4', 'ko', 'Place the potato slices in a large pot and cover with cold water. Season with salt and bring to boil for 5 minutes. Drain in a colander and allow the potatoes to steam for 1 minute.'),
('fca4c287-60f1-4212-877d-62624e0c2752', 'en', 'Rub a 10-inch baking dish with the garlic clove and generously butter the dish. Finely chop the garlic. Set aside.'),
('fca4c287-60f1-4212-877d-62624e0c2752', 'ko', 'Rub a 10-inch baking dish with the garlic clove and generously butter the dish. Finely chop the garlic. Set aside.'),
('758b0c37-19e7-4772-87d8-ec47d6f4f8d1', 'en', 'With the heat off, transfer the potatoes back to the pot and add heavy cream, thyme, half of the Parmesan cheese, chopped garlic, melted butter, salt and pepper. Stir all of the ingredients together until the potatoes are well coated.'),
('758b0c37-19e7-4772-87d8-ec47d6f4f8d1', 'ko', 'With the heat off, transfer the potatoes back to the pot and add heavy cream, thyme, half of the Parmesan cheese, chopped garlic, melted butter, salt and pepper. Stir all of the ingredients together until the potatoes are well coated.'),
('fd141168-d3bb-4f77-872e-2870d89cac1d', 'en', 'Layer the potatoes on top of each other in the buttered baking dish. Pour any remaining liquid on top of the potatoes. Place the baking dish on the prepared baking sheet. Cover the baking dish with foil and bake for 40 minutes. Remove the foil from the baking dish, add the remaining cheese and bake for 15-20 minutes, or until golden brown.'),
('fd141168-d3bb-4f77-872e-2870d89cac1d', 'ko', 'Layer the potatoes on top of each other in the buttered baking dish. Pour any remaining liquid on top of the potatoes. Place the baking dish on the prepared baking sheet. Cover the baking dish with foil and bake for 40 minutes. Remove the foil from the baking dish, add the remaining cheese and bake for 15-20 minutes, or until golden brown.'),
('c7a6cad2-f77a-4d67-82e9-e7992e5d00f3', 'en', 'Preheat the oven to 200 degrees F (95 degrees C). Line a rimmed baking sheet with paper towels, and set a wire rack inside.'),
('c7a6cad2-f77a-4d67-82e9-e7992e5d00f3', 'ko', 'Preheat the oven to 200 degrees F (95 degrees C). Line a rimmed baking sheet with paper towels, and set a wire rack inside.'),
('02100d14-f5dd-4f25-8fec-7a66ebb83ddf', 'en', 'Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a rolling boil. Cook fettuccine at a boil until tender yet firm to the bite, about 8 minutes. Drain pasta in a colander over a heatproof bowl; reserve 1 1/2 cups pasta cooking water. Set fettuccine aside, and reserve pot.'),
('02100d14-f5dd-4f25-8fec-7a66ebb83ddf', 'ko', 'Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a rolling boil. Cook fettuccine at a boil until tender yet firm to the bite, about 8 minutes. Drain pasta in a colander over a heatproof bowl; reserve 1 1/2 cups pasta cooking water. Set fettuccine aside, and reserve pot.'),
('824a083b-d720-41e4-8984-e0b81dc8ff87', 'en', 'While pasta cooks, stir together breadcrumbs, flour, and 1/2 cup Asiago in a shallow dish until combined. Pour milk into a separate shallow dish. Season chicken on both sides with 1 teaspoon of the salt and 1/4 teaspoon of the pepper. Working with 1 cutlet at a time, dredge chicken in breadcrumb mixture. Dip in milk, and coat again in breadcrumb mixture, pressing firmly to adhere. Place prepared chicken on a plate.'),
('824a083b-d720-41e4-8984-e0b81dc8ff87', 'ko', 'While pasta cooks, stir together breadcrumbs, flour, and 1/2 cup Asiago in a shallow dish until combined. Pour milk into a separate shallow dish. Season chicken on both sides with 1 teaspoon of the salt and 1/4 teaspoon of the pepper. Working with 1 cutlet at a time, dredge chicken in breadcrumb mixture. Dip in milk, and coat again in breadcrumb mixture, pressing firmly to adhere. Place prepared chicken on a plate.'),
('1da2b055-21c7-47d9-8397-10f4b04f61b6', 'en', 'Pour oil to a depth of 1/4-inch in a large skillet; heat oil over medium-high heat to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Place prepared chicken in hot oil, and pan-fry until golden brown and cooked through, 2 to 3 minutes per side. Transfer fried chicken to the prepared wire rack. Once all chicken is fried, remove paper towels.'),
('1da2b055-21c7-47d9-8397-10f4b04f61b6', 'ko', 'Pour oil to a depth of 1/4-inch in a large skillet; heat oil over medium-high heat to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Place prepared chicken in hot oil, and pan-fry until golden brown and cooked through, 2 to 3 minutes per side. Transfer fried chicken to the prepared wire rack. Once all chicken is fried, remove paper towels.'),
('610aca2d-adaa-46a3-83ff-b0e3f7d66f0d', 'en', 'Place the baking sheet in the preheated oven to keep chicken warm until ready to serve.'),
('610aca2d-adaa-46a3-83ff-b0e3f7d66f0d', 'ko', 'Place the baking sheet in the preheated oven to keep chicken warm until ready to serve.'),
('68e41ea1-3b0e-4f91-8e73-731ccbe2713e', 'en', 'Melt butter over medium heat in the reserved pasta pot. Add garlic, and cook, stirring constantly, until fragrant and butter is foamy, about 2 minutes. Stir in heavy cream, and cook until bubbling, about 2 minutes. Whisk in remaining 2 cups Asiago, stirring constantly until thickened, 1 to 2 minutes.'),
('68e41ea1-3b0e-4f91-8e73-731ccbe2713e', 'ko', 'Melt butter over medium heat in the reserved pasta pot. Add garlic, and cook, stirring constantly, until fragrant and butter is foamy, about 2 minutes. Stir in heavy cream, and cook until bubbling, about 2 minutes. Whisk in remaining 2 cups Asiago, stirring constantly until thickened, 1 to 2 minutes.'),
('f002ace6-71a7-453e-8ce2-b21425faf9dc', 'en', 'Add cooked pasta, and remaining 2 teaspoons salt and 1/4 teaspoon pepper; cook, stirring constantly, until pasta is coated in sauce, about 2 minutes, adding reserved cooking liquid as needed, 1/4 cup at a time, to thin the sauce.'),
('f002ace6-71a7-453e-8ce2-b21425faf9dc', 'ko', 'Add cooked pasta, and remaining 2 teaspoons salt and 1/4 teaspoon pepper; cook, stirring constantly, until pasta is coated in sauce, about 2 minutes, adding reserved cooking liquid as needed, 1/4 cup at a time, to thin the sauce.'),
('92bc53cd-a82a-4ee5-8ffe-fde50eb7f25b', 'en', 'Slice chicken. Divide pasta among 4 large plates; top evenly with chicken, and garnish with parsley.'),
('92bc53cd-a82a-4ee5-8ffe-fde50eb7f25b', 'ko', 'Slice chicken. Divide pasta among 4 large plates; top evenly with chicken, and garnish with parsley.'),
