('93693475-0090-4a99-8284-e682d06bf6cc', 'ko', 'Bake crust in the preheated oven until golden and set, about 15 minutes.'),
('2b22563c-8b77-4f34-85d1-5f6efcc88828', 'en', 'While crust is baking, heat a saucepan over medium heat. Pour reserved peach juice into the saucepan; stir in sugar, cornstarch, and peach spice until smooth. Bring to a boil; cook and stir until thickened, about 2 minutes. Remove from heat; stir in canned and frozen peaches.'),
('2b22563c-8b77-4f34-85d1-5f6efcc88828', 'ko', 'While crust is baking, heat a saucepan over medium heat. Pour reserved peach juice into the saucepan; stir in sugar, cornstarch, and peach spice until smooth. Bring to a boil; cook and stir until thickened, about 2 minutes. Remove from heat; stir in canned and frozen peaches.'),
('acefa421-bfcf-4395-81cb-b50508f66c34', 'en', 'Remove crust from the oven and let cool for 5 minutes. Pour peach mixture into the crust.'),
('acefa421-bfcf-4395-81cb-b50508f66c34', 'ko', 'Remove crust from the oven and let cool for 5 minutes. Pour peach mixture into the crust.'),
