('c3da30c4-30d3-4257-8409-ed007c00a6e4', 'en', 'Meanwhile, combine cinnamon rolls together to form a square pastry disc. Roll out disc with a rolling pin on a lightly floured work surface. Cut into thin strips using a pizza cutter. Weave strips together to create a lattice topping.'),
('c3da30c4-30d3-4257-8409-ed007c00a6e4', 'ko', 'Meanwhile, combine cinnamon rolls together to form a square pastry disc. Roll out disc with a rolling pin on a lightly floured work surface. Cut into thin strips using a pizza cutter. Weave strips together to create a lattice topping.'),
('68651bd6-d850-4a19-82ba-7fab203d7998', 'en', 'Remove the baking dish from the oven; lay lattice over the peaches. Increase oven temperature to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).'),
('68651bd6-d850-4a19-82ba-7fab203d7998', 'ko', 'Remove the baking dish from the oven; lay lattice over the peaches. Increase oven temperature to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).'),
('625f6332-d22e-4939-89ac-2986f7414583', 'en', 'Bake cobbler in the preheated oven until golden brown, about 12 minutes. Drizzle the included cinnamon roll icing over the lattice crust. Serve warm.'),
('625f6332-d22e-4939-89ac-2986f7414583', 'ko', 'Bake cobbler in the preheated oven until golden brown, about 12 minutes. Drizzle the included cinnamon roll icing over the lattice crust. Serve warm.'),
('c1023d2e-91d7-4dce-81fe-11ba5b450cc3', 'en', 'Coat a 9x13-inch metal baking pan with cooking spray and 1 tablespoon olive oil and place inside the oven. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). C'),
('c1023d2e-91d7-4dce-81fe-11ba5b450cc3', 'ko', 'Coat a 9x13-inch metal baking pan with cooking spray and 1 tablespoon olive oil and place inside the oven. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). C'),
('29468fa1-2f45-4b27-87b6-7d41c4d98b26', 'en', 'Combine chickpeas, onion, cilantro, parsley, garlic, lemon zest, cumin, salt, red pepper flakes, and baking powder in a food processor. Pulse until minced but not yet pasty. Transfer to a bowl and stir in flour and egg until fully incorporated.'),
('29468fa1-2f45-4b27-87b6-7d41c4d98b26', 'ko', 'Combine chickpeas, onion, cilantro, parsley, garlic, lemon zest, cumin, salt, red pepper flakes, and baking powder in a food processor. Pulse until minced but not yet pasty. Transfer to a bowl and stir in flour and egg until fully incorporated.'),
('f195426f-0690-493c-80a5-8185891246f9', 'en', 'Remove baking pan from the oven. Drop golfball-sized portions of chickpea mixture onto the hot pan.'),
