('c90e5cc3-fd9b-4675-887b-f40b7a0cf6e0', 'en', 'Bake in the preheated oven 15 to 20 minutes. Brush falafel with remaining olive oil and flip over. Continue baking until golden on both sides, 15 to 20 minutes more.'),
('c90e5cc3-fd9b-4675-887b-f40b7a0cf6e0', 'ko', 'Bake in the preheated oven 15 to 20 minutes. Brush falafel with remaining olive oil and flip over. Continue baking until golden on both sides, 15 to 20 minutes more.'),
('82c05ee8-c1e4-4ec1-82af-0ccf33351573', 'en', 'Meanwhile, combine yogurt, cucumber, lemon juice, and garlic in a bowl. Season with salt and cayenne pepper. Store in the refrigerator until ready to serve.'),
