('b163b679-9786-4212-8380-712cd4b6dbb4', 'en', 'Whisk potato starch, sweet rice flour, and salt together in a bowl. Sprinkle over potato mixture; stir until a soft dough has formed. Cut dough into 4 equal parts with a knife or pastry cutter.'),
('b163b679-9786-4212-8380-712cd4b6dbb4', 'ko', 'Whisk potato starch, sweet rice flour, and salt together in a bowl. Sprinkle over potato mixture; stir until a soft dough has formed. Cut dough into 4 equal parts with a knife or pastry cutter.'),
('9926ceab-5b1b-438e-8833-d148223471d4', 'en', 'Dust the work surface with rice flour to keep dough from sticking. Roll out 1 piece of dough into a rope about 1 inch in diameter. Cut into 1-inch gnocchi. Gently roll each one with the back of a fork to create ridges. Repeat with remaining dough.'),
('9926ceab-5b1b-438e-8833-d148223471d4', 'ko', 'Dust the work surface with rice flour to keep dough from sticking. Roll out 1 piece of dough into a rope about 1 inch in diameter. Cut into 1-inch gnocchi. Gently roll each one with the back of a fork to create ridges. Repeat with remaining dough.'),
('ad9b81f6-a790-4e35-8fc2-c2ed828ba0ec', 'en', 'Shake off any excess rice flour and let gnocchi rest, about 5 minutes.'),
('ad9b81f6-a790-4e35-8fc2-c2ed828ba0ec', 'ko', 'Shake off any excess rice flour and let gnocchi rest, about 5 minutes.'),
('9555b8c0-bdf9-4769-8a89-a2cb4cc3ae2d', 'en', 'Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil. Add gnocchi in batches and cook, without stirring, until they float to the top, 1 to 2 minutes. Remove with a slotted spoon.'),
('9555b8c0-bdf9-4769-8a89-a2cb4cc3ae2d', 'ko', 'Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil. Add gnocchi in batches and cook, without stirring, until they float to the top, 1 to 2 minutes. Remove with a slotted spoon.'),
('b29addec-dd23-4050-84b4-be067a48d5ec', 'en', 'Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Lightly spray an 8x8-inch baking dish.'),
('b29addec-dd23-4050-84b4-be067a48d5ec', 'ko', 'Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Lightly spray an 8x8-inch baking dish.'),
('7138a192-de7f-476b-8a48-1b1c570947b7', 'en', 'Place bacon in a large skillet and cook over medium-high heat, turning occasionally, until evenly browned, about 10 minutes. Drain bacon slices on paper towels. Crumble once cooled.'),
('7138a192-de7f-476b-8a48-1b1c570947b7', 'ko', 'Place bacon in a large skillet and cook over medium-high heat, turning occasionally, until evenly browned, about 10 minutes. Drain bacon slices on paper towels. Crumble once cooled.'),
('95633afe-f124-442f-8adf-fb78a265eb6e', 'en', 'Saute onion in the same skillet until translucent, 4 to 5 minutes. Add green chiles and garlic and cook for 2 more minutes. Add pinto beans; bring to a boil. Stir in chicken broth and chili powder. Reduce heat to low and mash beans. Let simmer until slightly thickened, 5 to 6 minutes. Add cream cheese and stir until melted. Simmer until slightly thickened, 5 to 6 minutes. Add bacon and stir until well combined. Season with salt and pepper.'),
('95633afe-f124-442f-8adf-fb78a265eb6e', 'ko', 'Saute onion in the same skillet until translucent, 4 to 5 minutes. Add green chiles and garlic and cook for 2 more minutes. Add pinto beans; bring to a boil. Stir in chicken broth and chili powder. Reduce heat to low and mash beans. Let simmer until slightly thickened, 5 to 6 minutes. Add cream cheese and stir until melted. Simmer until slightly thickened, 5 to 6 minutes. Add bacon and stir until well combined. Season with salt and pepper.'),
('b5134cb8-58bd-48cf-879a-6228932d7858', 'en', 'Layer 1/2 of the bean mixture, 1/2 cup pepper Jack, and 1/2 cup Cheddar cheese into the prepared baking dish. Repeat layers.'),
('b5134cb8-58bd-48cf-879a-6228932d7858', 'ko', 'Layer 1/2 of the bean mixture, 1/2 cup pepper Jack, and 1/2 cup Cheddar cheese into the prepared baking dish. Repeat layers.'),
('3500bfcc-26eb-49ef-8a57-d75b2fee2526', 'en', 'Bake, covered, in the preheated oven for 15 minutes. Uncover and continue baking until cheese is melted or lightly browned, 5 to 7 minutes more.'),
('3500bfcc-26eb-49ef-8a57-d75b2fee2526', 'ko', 'Bake, covered, in the preheated oven for 15 minutes. Uncover and continue baking until cheese is melted or lightly browned, 5 to 7 minutes more.'),
('41ad5654-0002-4482-87ac-113028dfe212', 'en', 'Meanwhile, preheat an air fryer to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C) according to manufacturer''s instructions.'),
('41ad5654-0002-4482-87ac-113028dfe212', 'ko', 'Meanwhile, preheat an air fryer to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C) according to manufacturer''s instructions.'),
('4e906085-6ce1-421f-8e47-a41cb590d865', 'en', 'Cut each tortilla into fourths. Spray both sides of each tortilla with avocado oil. Place in air fryer basket in a single layer. Air fry for 4 to 6 minutes. Flip and continue cooking until crisp, 2 to 3 minutes more. Check your basket constantly because they can burn quickly. Sprinkle with salt and serve with hot dip.'),
('4e906085-6ce1-421f-8e47-a41cb590d865', 'ko', 'Cut each tortilla into fourths. Spray both sides of each tortilla with avocado oil. Place in air fryer basket in a single layer. Air fry for 4 to 6 minutes. Flip and continue cooking until crisp, 2 to 3 minutes more. Check your basket constantly because they can burn quickly. Sprinkle with salt and serve with hot dip.'),
('7e19c708-85e4-4d47-84cd-776c36a70daa', 'en', 'Place potatoes into a large pot and cover with salted water; bring to a boil. Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer until tender, about 20 minutes. Drain.'),
('7e19c708-85e4-4d47-84cd-776c36a70daa', 'ko', 'Place potatoes into a large pot and cover with salted water; bring to a boil. Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer until tender, about 20 minutes. Drain.'),
('67f6b576-2f76-4d77-89a5-8aa254ea383d', 'en', 'Combine flour, buttermilk, water, and 1 teaspoon salt in a bowl. Whisk with a fork; when the dough thickens, start kneading by hand. Knead for at least 10 minutes, applying all of your strength so you will have to put less effort into rolling. Cover dough and let rest at least 30 minutes.'),
('67f6b576-2f76-4d77-89a5-8aa254ea383d', 'ko', 'Combine flour, buttermilk, water, and 1 teaspoon salt in a bowl. Whisk with a fork; when the dough thickens, start kneading by hand. Knead for at least 10 minutes, applying all of your strength so you will have to put less effort into rolling. Cover dough and let rest at least 30 minutes.'),
('e98f6dff-7767-4205-8d7c-69b4bf0a2011', 'en', 'Peel and mash the boiled potatoes in a bowl. Add mozzarella cheese and combine well. Add salt to taste if the mixture is too bland. Divide filling into 12 balls; place on a plate or baking sheet and cover.'),
('e98f6dff-7767-4205-8d7c-69b4bf0a2011', 'ko', 'Peel and mash the boiled potatoes in a bowl. Add mozzarella cheese and combine well. Add salt to taste if the mixture is too bland. Divide filling into 12 balls; place on a plate or baking sheet and cover.'),
('96f93885-c4df-46fd-8c64-c06e0dccc710', 'en', 'Divide dough into 12 balls; these will be smaller than the filling balls. Place on a plate or baking sheet and cover.'),
('96f93885-c4df-46fd-8c64-c06e0dccc710', 'ko', 'Divide dough into 12 balls; these will be smaller than the filling balls. Place on a plate or baking sheet and cover.'),
('5ade0687-7d55-4c17-8d93-16639134f730', 'en', 'Stretch 1 piece of dough into a small, flat circle. Place a filling ball in the center; pull up the edges of the dough and secure to have a ball encased in dough. Repeat with remaining dough and filling.'),
('5ade0687-7d55-4c17-8d93-16639134f730', 'ko', 'Stretch 1 piece of dough into a small, flat circle. Place a filling ball in the center; pull up the edges of the dough and secure to have a ball encased in dough. Repeat with remaining dough and filling.'),
('8484ea53-dd54-4336-8c61-4125d2e38fa7', 'en', 'Heat a heavy-bottomed frying pan over medium heat; use no oil or grease. Place melted butter in a bowl nearby. Sprinkle a work surface with a generous amount of flour. Carefully and gently start to roll out a ball; the dough will be hard to work at first. Be careful not to press too hard with the rolling pin to avoid rips; roll into a circle about 1/4-inch thick.'),
('8484ea53-dd54-4336-8c61-4125d2e38fa7', 'ko', 'Heat a heavy-bottomed frying pan over medium heat; use no oil or grease. Place melted butter in a bowl nearby. Sprinkle a work surface with a generous amount of flour. Carefully and gently start to roll out a ball; the dough will be hard to work at first. Be careful not to press too hard with the rolling pin to avoid rips; roll into a circle about 1/4-inch thick.'),
('6a2ba7b8-06ee-4e7e-8e4b-0facd947c115', 'en', 'Place hychin into the hot pan. Fry until golden-brown spots appear, about 2 minutes. Pierce with a knife to deflate, if necessary. Turn over and cook on the other side, about 2 minutes more. Brush generously with butter and transfer to a plate. Repeat with remaining balls and stack cooked hychin on the plate.'),
('6a2ba7b8-06ee-4e7e-8e4b-0facd947c115', 'ko', 'Place hychin into the hot pan. Fry until golden-brown spots appear, about 2 minutes. Pierce with a knife to deflate, if necessary. Turn over and cook on the other side, about 2 minutes more. Brush generously with butter and transfer to a plate. Repeat with remaining balls and stack cooked hychin on the plate.'),
('76d951af-5e57-4e10-89e2-7abecd8597a6', 'en', 'Cut the whole hychin stack into 8 slices like a pie.'),
('76d951af-5e57-4e10-89e2-7abecd8597a6', 'ko', 'Cut the whole hychin stack into 8 slices like a pie.'),
('7f07bec1-5305-448a-80b0-1d83080aa777', 'en', 'Gather all ingredients.'),
('7f07bec1-5305-448a-80b0-1d83080aa777', 'ko', 'Gather all ingredients.'),
('15e9d5e6-6fb8-4257-894d-e5091107df6c', 'en', 'Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil; add lasagna noodles and cook for 4 to 5 minutes. Drain, toss in 1 tablespoon olive oil in the lasagna pot or in a large bowl, and set aside.'),
('15e9d5e6-6fb8-4257-894d-e5091107df6c', 'ko', 'Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil; add lasagna noodles and cook for 4 to 5 minutes. Drain, toss in 1 tablespoon olive oil in the lasagna pot or in a large bowl, and set aside.'),
('b9b4f071-26e5-4d49-8fe4-e317fdffee81', 'en', 'Add a drizzle of olive oil to a large skillet; place over medium heat and sauté garlic until fragrant, about 30 seconds. Add 2 cups spinach and cook until just wilted, about 3 minutes. Remove from the pan and use kitchen shears to roughly chop the spinach; add to a small bowl and stir in ricotta and 1/4 cup Parmesan. Season with salt and pepper. Set aside.'),
('b9b4f071-26e5-4d49-8fe4-e317fdffee81', 'ko', 'Add a drizzle of olive oil to a large skillet; place over medium heat and sauté garlic until fragrant, about 30 seconds. Add 2 cups spinach and cook until just wilted, about 3 minutes. Remove from the pan and use kitchen shears to roughly chop the spinach; add to a small bowl and stir in ricotta and 1/4 cup Parmesan. Season with salt and pepper. Set aside.'),
('1d712cc9-0ee2-4add-8dc3-ca06ecfe68d7', 'en', 'Cook sausage in the same skillet over medium heat until browned and cooked through, breaking it into crumbles, about 5 minutes. Add artichokes and sauté for 2 to 3 minutes. Pour in cream and bring to a gentle simmer. Season with salt, pepper, and red pepper flakes. Simmer until slightly thickened, 2 to 3 minutes, then stir in remaining spinach and cook until just wilted.'),
('1d712cc9-0ee2-4add-8dc3-ca06ecfe68d7', 'ko', 'Cook sausage in the same skillet over medium heat until browned and cooked through, breaking it into crumbles, about 5 minutes. Add artichokes and sauté for 2 to 3 minutes. Pour in cream and bring to a gentle simmer. Season with salt, pepper, and red pepper flakes. Simmer until slightly thickened, 2 to 3 minutes, then stir in remaining spinach and cook until just wilted.'),
('a88b98a9-7cef-4303-8d77-2bf257ac44c1', 'en', 'Pour sausage mixture into lasagna noodles. Stir in 1/2 cup Parmesan and half of mozzarella. Mix until cheese is melted and lasagna noodles are fully coated.'),
('a88b98a9-7cef-4303-8d77-2bf257ac44c1', 'ko', 'Pour sausage mixture into lasagna noodles. Stir in 1/2 cup Parmesan and half of mozzarella. Mix until cheese is melted and lasagna noodles are fully coated.'),
('2e9ba74b-ae85-4aac-8e0e-2ce5109758dd', 'en', 'Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Lightly grease a 18x13-inch baking sheet or 9x13-inch baking dish.'),
('2e9ba74b-ae85-4aac-8e0e-2ce5109758dd', 'ko', 'Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Lightly grease a 18x13-inch baking sheet or 9x13-inch baking dish.'),
('977f7036-5dd4-4956-8da6-5191716a2928', 'en', 'Spread pasta mixture evenly across the prepared pan. Dollop ricotta-spinach mixture over the top. Sprinkle mozzarella cheese and Parmesan evenly across the entire surface.'),
('977f7036-5dd4-4956-8da6-5191716a2928', 'ko', 'Spread pasta mixture evenly across the prepared pan. Dollop ricotta-spinach mixture over the top. Sprinkle mozzarella cheese and Parmesan evenly across the entire surface.'),
('87efceed-a8fa-451a-83a2-6aff80638b3a', 'en', 'Bake in the preheated oven until bubbling and golden, 15 to 20 minutes. Optionally, for a more golden crust, turn on the oven''s broiler and broil the top for 1 to 2 minutes at the end. Let cool slightly, garnish with fresh herbs if desired, and cut into squares to serve.'),
('87efceed-a8fa-451a-83a2-6aff80638b3a', 'ko', 'Bake in the preheated oven until bubbling and golden, 15 to 20 minutes. Optionally, for a more golden crust, turn on the oven''s broiler and broil the top for 1 to 2 minutes at the end. Let cool slightly, garnish with fresh herbs if desired, and cut into squares to serve.'),
('5f285f30-aa9c-47b4-8f97-8fa11182374e', 'en', 'Place eggs in a saucepan; cover with water. Bring to a boil, remove from heat, and let eggs stand in water for 15 minutes. Remove eggs from water, cool under cold running water, and peel.'),
('5f285f30-aa9c-47b4-8f97-8fa11182374e', 'ko', 'Place eggs in a saucepan; cover with water. Bring to a boil, remove from heat, and let eggs stand in water for 15 minutes. Remove eggs from water, cool under cold running water, and peel.'),
('62ea292a-4b9d-40ae-8189-f4f88e35f546', 'en', 'Place bacon in a large skillet; cook over medium-high heat, turning occasionally, until evenly browned, about 10 minutes. Drain on paper towels; crumble when cool.'),
('62ea292a-4b9d-40ae-8189-f4f88e35f546', 'ko', 'Place bacon in a large skillet; cook over medium-high heat, turning occasionally, until evenly browned, about 10 minutes. Drain on paper towels; crumble when cool.'),
('b524bfdb-3b89-4114-8e1e-b94139c18fd0', 'en', 'Remove seeds and stems from jalapeños; mince 1 pepper and slice remaining 2 peppers into 24 very thin strips; set aside.'),
('b524bfdb-3b89-4114-8e1e-b94139c18fd0', 'ko', 'Remove seeds and stems from jalapeños; mince 1 pepper and slice remaining 2 peppers into 24 very thin strips; set aside.'),
('4b1bb2f6-b631-46ed-87c4-4690946af8fa', 'en', 'Cut eggs in half lengthwise; place yolks in a bowl. Mash with a fork; stir in minced jalapeño, Cheddar cheese, mayonnaise, red onion, and mustard.'),
('4b1bb2f6-b631-46ed-87c4-4690946af8fa', 'ko', 'Cut eggs in half lengthwise; place yolks in a bowl. Mash with a fork; stir in minced jalapeño, Cheddar cheese, mayonnaise, red onion, and mustard.'),
('fb053af2-b629-498b-85f0-9cf15db65af0', 'en', 'Place egg whites, cut side up, on a serving platter. Spoon yolk mixture into egg white halves; insert pepper strip into each yolk; sprinkle with crumbled bacon and paprika.'),
('fb053af2-b629-498b-85f0-9cf15db65af0', 'ko', 'Place egg whites, cut side up, on a serving platter. Spoon yolk mixture into egg white halves; insert pepper strip into each yolk; sprinkle with crumbled bacon and paprika.'),
('81661a55-e5ee-492b-82f3-b9657f8ab1ff', 'en', 'Bring a large pot of water to a boil. Cut the ends off of the bananas, and make a slit lengthwise down the peel. Cook bananas in boiling water until tender (similar to a potato). Drain, cool, and remove peels. Cut into small chunks and place in a serving bowl. Drizzle 1 tablespoon of olive oil over the pieces, and stir to coat.'),
('81661a55-e5ee-492b-82f3-b9657f8ab1ff', 'ko', 'Bring a large pot of water to a boil. Cut the ends off of the bananas, and make a slit lengthwise down the peel. Cook bananas in boiling water until tender (similar to a potato). Drain, cool, and remove peels. Cut into small chunks and place in a serving bowl. Drizzle 1 tablespoon of olive oil over the pieces, and stir to coat.'),
('a27dc69d-35c7-433b-8018-ae6b9bbb7a39', 'en', 'Meanwhile, heat the remaining tablespoon of oil in a skillet over medium-high heat. Add shrimp and crab, and fry until cooked through, about 5 minutes. Set aside to cool.'),
('a27dc69d-35c7-433b-8018-ae6b9bbb7a39', 'ko', 'Meanwhile, heat the remaining tablespoon of oil in a skillet over medium-high heat. Add shrimp and crab, and fry until cooked through, about 5 minutes. Set aside to cool.'),
('5caf51ad-8cfb-4d6a-8731-594e3e697777', 'en', 'Add onions, green pepper and seafood to the bananas in the bowl. In a separate bowl, whisk together the red wine vinegar, sugar and bacon pieces. Pour this mixture over the bananas, and toss lightly to coat. Season with salt and pepper. Garnish with slices of hard-cooked egg if desired.'),
('5caf51ad-8cfb-4d6a-8731-594e3e697777', 'ko', 'Add onions, green pepper and seafood to the bananas in the bowl. In a separate bowl, whisk together the red wine vinegar, sugar and bacon pieces. Pour this mixture over the bananas, and toss lightly to coat. Season with salt and pepper. Garnish with slices of hard-cooked egg if desired.'),
('a7446a71-7702-4d91-81f2-e802ea96b06f', 'en', 'Preheat the oven to 200 degrees F (95 degrees C). Place a serving platter into the oven to warm.'),
('a7446a71-7702-4d91-81f2-e802ea96b06f', 'ko', 'Preheat the oven to 200 degrees F (95 degrees C). Place a serving platter into the oven to warm.'),
('fbbe4378-1215-4902-8891-bdcfa3fc9075', 'en', 'Season chicken breast pieces with salt and pepper and dredge them in flour. Shake off excess flour. Heat vegetable oil in a skillet; pan-fry the chicken pieces until golden brown on both sides, about 3 minutes per side. Work in batches and do not crowd skillet, adding oil as needed. Place chicken pieces onto the warmed platter in the oven. When finished with all of the chicken, drain most of the oil from the skillet, leaving a thin coating on the surface of the pan.'),
('fbbe4378-1215-4902-8891-bdcfa3fc9075', 'ko', 'Season chicken breast pieces with salt and pepper and dredge them in flour. Shake off excess flour. Heat vegetable oil in a skillet; pan-fry the chicken pieces until golden brown on both sides, about 3 minutes per side. Work in batches and do not crowd skillet, adding oil as needed. Place chicken pieces onto the warmed platter in the oven. When finished with all of the chicken, drain most of the oil from the skillet, leaving a thin coating on the surface of the pan.'),
('e57a382c-eb05-441c-86ba-8ed5a7ddb741', 'en', 'Cook and stir minced garlic in the skillet until fragrant, about 20 seconds. Pour in chicken broth; scrape and stir any brown bits from the bottom of the skillet. Stir in lemon slices and bring the mixture to a boil. Let cook, stirring occasionally, until the sauce reduces to about 2/3 cup, 5 to 8 minutes. Add lemon juice and capers; simmer until sauce is reduced and slightly thickened, about 5 minutes more. Drop butter into the skillet and swirl it into sauce by tilting the skillet until butter is melted and incorporated. Add parsley; remove from heat and set aside.'),
('e57a382c-eb05-441c-86ba-8ed5a7ddb741', 'ko', 'Cook and stir minced garlic in the skillet until fragrant, about 20 seconds. Pour in chicken broth; scrape and stir any brown bits from the bottom of the skillet. Stir in lemon slices and bring the mixture to a boil. Let cook, stirring occasionally, until the sauce reduces to about 2/3 cup, 5 to 8 minutes. Add lemon juice and capers; simmer until sauce is reduced and slightly thickened, about 5 minutes more. Drop butter into the skillet and swirl it into sauce by tilting the skillet until butter is melted and incorporated. Add parsley; remove from heat and set aside.'),
('ecd92208-7325-4b6c-816b-ee4b5fb05dc6', 'en', 'Arrange chicken medallions on serving plates and spoon sauce over each portion to serve.'),
('ecd92208-7325-4b6c-816b-ee4b5fb05dc6', 'ko', 'Arrange chicken medallions on serving plates and spoon sauce over each portion to serve.'),
('e8d58d6b-be70-4fbc-8146-0eccf44ce18d', 'en', 'Preheat the oven to 450 degrees F (230 degrees C). Butter a 13x9-inch baking dish.'),
('e8d58d6b-be70-4fbc-8146-0eccf44ce18d', 'ko', 'Preheat the oven to 450 degrees F (230 degrees C). Butter a 13x9-inch baking dish.'),
('eb225511-4037-4c7d-8e77-596cf0a1b8b0', 'en', 'For the mashed potato, add quartered russet potatoes to a pot with 3 tablespoons salt and enough water to cover by 2 inches. Bring to a boil over high heat; reduce heat to medium and simmer until tender when pierced with a sharp knife, but not falling apart, 15 to 20 minutes. Drain very well.'),
('eb225511-4037-4c7d-8e77-596cf0a1b8b0', 'ko', 'For the mashed potato, add quartered russet potatoes to a pot with 3 tablespoons salt and enough water to cover by 2 inches. Bring to a boil over high heat; reduce heat to medium and simmer until tender when pierced with a sharp knife, but not falling apart, 15 to 20 minutes. Drain very well.'),
('bf53b516-a409-4b9d-8d17-fb04a0d6d200', 'en', 'Return potatoes to the pot, and mash until almost smooth. Add butter, salt, and cayenne. Mash until smooth.'),
('bf53b516-a409-4b9d-8d17-fb04a0d6d200', 'ko', 'Return potatoes to the pot, and mash until almost smooth. Add butter, salt, and cayenne. Mash until smooth.'),
('98503abd-b21a-4501-874b-bf7c79377a1b', 'en', 'Add milk and the 4 ounces shredded cheese, and mash and mix until evenly combined. Spread evenly into the prepared baking dish, and smooth the top. Season the top with salt and freshly ground black pepper.'),
('98503abd-b21a-4501-874b-bf7c79377a1b', 'ko', 'Add milk and the 4 ounces shredded cheese, and mash and mix until evenly combined. Spread evenly into the prepared baking dish, and smooth the top. Season the top with salt and freshly ground black pepper.'),
('5c96838f-4576-4b0f-8108-810c11d9e038', 'en', 'For the au gratin potato layer, slice each half potato into 1/8-inch slices.'),
('5c96838f-4576-4b0f-8108-810c11d9e038', 'ko', 'For the au gratin potato layer, slice each half potato into 1/8-inch slices.'),
('b1f7c29e-f386-4682-8035-0ee8f48f55ce', 'en', 'Fan the potato out slightly at an angle, and place on top of mashed potatoes. Repeat with remaining potato halves to cover the surface, creating 4 rows across by 2 potato halves long, using 8 halves total. Depending on the size of potato and dish, you may have to adjust the layout to cover.'),
('b1f7c29e-f386-4682-8035-0ee8f48f55ce', 'ko', 'Fan the potato out slightly at an angle, and place on top of mashed potatoes. Repeat with remaining potato halves to cover the surface, creating 4 rows across by 2 potato halves long, using 8 halves total. Depending on the size of potato and dish, you may have to adjust the layout to cover.'),
('0ca09938-56e0-4b68-877b-f84c0aa5112b', 'en', 'Generously salt sliced potatoes, and brush generously with melted butter. Scatter the 2 ounces shredded cheese on top, and finish with grated Parmigiano-Reggiano.'),
('0ca09938-56e0-4b68-877b-f84c0aa5112b', 'ko', 'Generously salt sliced potatoes, and brush generously with melted butter. Scatter the 2 ounces shredded cheese on top, and finish with grated Parmigiano-Reggiano.'),
('8f0a557d-0306-4000-8f5f-93102b38e9f8', 'en', 'Bake in the preheated oven until sliced potatoes on top are tender when pierced with a knife, about 1 hour.'),
('8f0a557d-0306-4000-8f5f-93102b38e9f8', 'ko', 'Bake in the preheated oven until sliced potatoes on top are tender when pierced with a knife, about 1 hour.'),
('694288bf-1297-4758-851b-36fcbb43c4eb', 'en', 'Place the potatoes into a large pot and cover with salted water. Bring to a boil; reduce heat to medium-low, cover, and simmer until tender, about 20 minutes. Drain. Cover with cold water and allow to sit until cool, draining and replacing the cold water as needed. Peel and slice the potatoes thinly.'),
('694288bf-1297-4758-851b-36fcbb43c4eb', 'ko', 'Place the potatoes into a large pot and cover with salted water. Bring to a boil; reduce heat to medium-low, cover, and simmer until tender, about 20 minutes. Drain. Cover with cold water and allow to sit until cool, draining and replacing the cold water as needed. Peel and slice the potatoes thinly.'),
('2d112a8d-f85d-4d7e-8d94-aa3f102ac8aa', 'en', 'Preheat an oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).'),
('2d112a8d-f85d-4d7e-8d94-aa3f102ac8aa', 'ko', 'Preheat an oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).'),
('e4f8bd0a-5b0c-47cb-8116-394ff5ffc332', 'en', 'Grease a casserole dish with the olive oil. Line the casserole dish with an even layer of potato slices; top with a layer of sardine fillets. Scatter the diced tomatoes over the sardines. Sprinkle the garlic, basil, and bread crumbs over the tomatoes.'),
('e4f8bd0a-5b0c-47cb-8116-394ff5ffc332', 'ko', 'Grease a casserole dish with the olive oil. Line the casserole dish with an even layer of potato slices; top with a layer of sardine fillets. Scatter the diced tomatoes over the sardines. Sprinkle the garlic, basil, and bread crumbs over the tomatoes.'),
('20d61e89-e002-4c0a-8a59-bd1c5f4d708a', 'en', 'Bake in the preheated oven until heated through, about 20 minutes.'),
('20d61e89-e002-4c0a-8a59-bd1c5f4d708a', 'ko', 'Bake in the preheated oven until heated through, about 20 minutes.'),
('769d6654-5997-4111-8448-ff9c64ae9db5', 'en', 'Pour 2 cups oil (or amount needed for a depth of 1 inch) into a deep skillet; heat over medium heat.'),
('769d6654-5997-4111-8448-ff9c64ae9db5', 'ko', 'Pour 2 cups oil (or amount needed for a depth of 1 inch) into a deep skillet; heat over medium heat.'),
('79b6f5bc-5fc0-48f2-8113-d8a2fe9d59b2', 'en', 'Pat eggplant slices dry with a paper towel. Set aside 4 whole basil leaves; chop remaining leaves.'),
('79b6f5bc-5fc0-48f2-8113-d8a2fe9d59b2', 'ko', 'Pat eggplant slices dry with a paper towel. Set aside 4 whole basil leaves; chop remaining leaves.'),
('f515596c-824c-48ac-8490-6c57ec864b7c', 'en', 'Fry eggplant in batches in hot oil until golden, 2 to 3 minutes per side. Transfer eggplant to a paper towel-lined plate using a slotted spoon; season with salt.'),
('f515596c-824c-48ac-8490-6c57ec864b7c', 'ko', 'Fry eggplant in batches in hot oil until golden, 2 to 3 minutes per side. Transfer eggplant to a paper towel-lined plate using a slotted spoon; season with salt.'),
('800a250f-6b07-4e5f-8a4b-c176379a5394', 'en', 'Simmer passata, 1 tablespoon olive oil, garlic cloves, 4 basil leaves, and a pinch salt in a saucepan over medium heat for 10 minutes. Remove from the heat and discard garlic cloves.'),
('800a250f-6b07-4e5f-8a4b-c176379a5394', 'ko', 'Simmer passata, 1 tablespoon olive oil, garlic cloves, 4 basil leaves, and a pinch salt in a saucepan over medium heat for 10 minutes. Remove from the heat and discard garlic cloves.'),
('92ddcdd2-7c55-48f6-8961-6381574baaa2', 'en', 'Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Lightly grease a baking dish.'),
('92ddcdd2-7c55-48f6-8961-6381574baaa2', 'ko', 'Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Lightly grease a baking dish.'),
('51b71c39-42c5-4e00-8bc0-9bf6b0fd6746', 'en', 'Layer ingredients in the baking dish in the following order as many times as possible: fried eggplant, tomato sauce, mozzarella cheese, oregano, Parmesan cheese, and basil leaves. End with a layer of mozzarella and a drizzle of remaining 1 tablespoon olive oil.'),
('51b71c39-42c5-4e00-8bc0-9bf6b0fd6746', 'ko', 'Layer ingredients in the baking dish in the following order as many times as possible: fried eggplant, tomato sauce, mozzarella cheese, oregano, Parmesan cheese, and basil leaves. End with a layer of mozzarella and a drizzle of remaining 1 tablespoon olive oil.'),
('97d6e5e8-98c0-4fec-899e-51506c8081b6', 'en', 'Bake in the preheated oven until heated through and cheeses are melted, about 40 minutes. Let stand a few minutes before slicing.'),
('97d6e5e8-98c0-4fec-899e-51506c8081b6', 'ko', 'Bake in the preheated oven until heated through and cheeses are melted, about 40 minutes. Let stand a few minutes before slicing.'),
('d237374c-4eb1-4150-8d77-be30b3df1637', 'en', 'Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Line baking sheets with aluminum foil.'),
('d237374c-4eb1-4150-8d77-be30b3df1637', 'ko', 'Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Line baking sheets with aluminum foil.'),
('f8504b4c-a67c-4786-88df-809f8327c602', 'en', 'Make sauce: Melt butter in a skillet over medium-high heat. Whisk flour into hot butter and cook, whisking constantly, until mixture is pale and flour taste cooks off, about 1 minute. Whisk milk into flour mixture until mixture is hot and thickened, 3 to 6 minutes. Add provolone cheese, nutmeg, cayenne pepper, and salt; stir until cheese is completely melted. Set aside.'),
('f8504b4c-a67c-4786-88df-809f8327c602', 'ko', 'Make sauce: Melt butter in a skillet over medium-high heat. Whisk flour into hot butter and cook, whisking constantly, until mixture is pale and flour taste cooks off, about 1 minute. Whisk milk into flour mixture until mixture is hot and thickened, 3 to 6 minutes. Add provolone cheese, nutmeg, cayenne pepper, and salt; stir until cheese is completely melted. Set aside.'),
('da30fc70-abfb-45e5-8bac-5590b4f9aeb7', 'en', 'Make mini cheesesteaks: Season steak with salt and black pepper.'),
('da30fc70-abfb-45e5-8bac-5590b4f9aeb7', 'ko', 'Make mini cheesesteaks: Season steak with salt and black pepper.'),
('55e5a5e5-a87e-4f6e-82f9-75315b71deaa', 'en', 'Heat 1 tablespoon olive oil in a skillet over medium-high heat. Cook steak in hot oil, turning occasionally, until meat is slightly firm and pink on the inside, 5 to 7 minutes. Transfer meat to a plate.'),
('55e5a5e5-a87e-4f6e-82f9-75315b71deaa', 'ko', 'Heat 1 tablespoon olive oil in a skillet over medium-high heat. Cook steak in hot oil, turning occasionally, until meat is slightly firm and pink on the inside, 5 to 7 minutes. Transfer meat to a plate.'),
('c65bae6a-2868-45de-8e1a-096c684caa43', 'en', 'Return the skillet to heat and pour in water; bring to a boil while scraping the browned bits of food off of the bottom of the pan with a wooden spoon. Pour liquid from the skillet over steak. Cool steak to room temperature; dice meat and place meat and accumulated juices from the plate into a large bowl.'),
('c65bae6a-2868-45de-8e1a-096c684caa43', 'ko', 'Return the skillet to heat and pour in water; bring to a boil while scraping the browned bits of food off of the bottom of the pan with a wooden spoon. Pour liquid from the skillet over steak. Cool steak to room temperature; dice meat and place meat and accumulated juices from the plate into a large bowl.'),
('45251f27-2d32-4c43-8989-895be4c0b3cb', 'en', 'Heat 1 tablespoon oil in a skillet over medium-high heat; sauté onion and peppers in hot oil until softened and slightly translucent, about 5 minutes. Stir onion and peppers into beef in the bowl; season with salt and pepper.'),
('45251f27-2d32-4c43-8989-895be4c0b3cb', 'ko', 'Heat 1 tablespoon oil in a skillet over medium-high heat; sauté onion and peppers in hot oil until softened and slightly translucent, about 5 minutes. Stir onion and peppers into beef in the bowl; season with salt and pepper.'),
('2640e609-49b8-4b1f-8664-bd540c505627', 'en', 'Spread bread slices out on the prepared baking sheets and drizzle with remaining 1 tablespoon olive oil. Flip slices over so the oiled sides face downward. Spread cheese sauce generously onto each slice. Spoon beef mixture on top. Sprinkle with provolone cheese.'),
('2640e609-49b8-4b1f-8664-bd540c505627', 'ko', 'Spread bread slices out on the prepared baking sheets and drizzle with remaining 1 tablespoon olive oil. Flip slices over so the oiled sides face downward. Spread cheese sauce generously onto each slice. Spoon beef mixture on top. Sprinkle with provolone cheese.'),
('76c4d53d-c450-4358-8a0d-ec1fba0f550c', 'en', 'Bake in the preheated oven until browned and cheese is melted, 12 to 15 minutes.'),
('76c4d53d-c450-4358-8a0d-ec1fba0f550c', 'ko', 'Bake in the preheated oven until browned and cheese is melted, 12 to 15 minutes.'),
('a995133e-fe04-42e3-855a-c276dfef102d', 'en', 'Heat oil in a large pot over medium heat. Add onion; saute until translucent, about 5 minutes. Mix in tomato puree and water; cook for 10 minutes. Stir in sugar and basil. Reduce heat to low; simmer for 30 minutes, stirring occasionally.'),
('a995133e-fe04-42e3-855a-c276dfef102d', 'ko', 'Heat oil in a large pot over medium heat. Add onion; saute until translucent, about 5 minutes. Mix in tomato puree and water; cook for 10 minutes. Stir in sugar and basil. Reduce heat to low; simmer for 30 minutes, stirring occasionally.'),
('5e3b0a0a-3da9-4147-807a-93801dbf609e', 'en', 'While the sauce is cooking, bring a very large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Add ziti and cook, stirring occasionally, until tender yet firm to the bite, about 8 minutes. Drain and return to the pot.'),
('5e3b0a0a-3da9-4147-807a-93801dbf609e', 'ko', 'While the sauce is cooking, bring a very large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Add ziti and cook, stirring occasionally, until tender yet firm to the bite, about 8 minutes. Drain and return to the pot.'),
('fa292f16-ada9-4102-871e-8b2ddc3f02f8', 'en', 'Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat. Cook and stir ground beef in the hot skillet until browned and crumbly, 5 to 7 minutes. Drain and discard grease. Add ground beef to cooked pasta. Mix in enough tomato sauce to lightly coat the pasta.'),
('fa292f16-ada9-4102-871e-8b2ddc3f02f8', 'ko', 'Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat. Cook and stir ground beef in the hot skillet until browned and crumbly, 5 to 7 minutes. Drain and discard grease. Add ground beef to cooked pasta. Mix in enough tomato sauce to lightly coat the pasta.'),
('feb8af44-d275-4590-8940-c48d5b81bf89', 'en', 'Mix ricotta cheese and water in a bowl until it reaches a spreadable consistency.'),
('feb8af44-d275-4590-8940-c48d5b81bf89', 'ko', 'Mix ricotta cheese and water in a bowl until it reaches a spreadable consistency.'),
('e8696c71-32ee-471f-8eef-940fb0b5e977', 'en', 'Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).'),
('e8696c71-32ee-471f-8eef-940fb0b5e977', 'ko', 'Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).'),
('d756ed4c-43be-4532-8a1b-e192e4e4260d', 'en', 'Spread a ladleful of sauce in the bottom of a 9x13-inch baking dish. Add 1/2 of the pasta, all of the ricotta cheese, peas, and 1/2 of the Parmesan cheese. Layer the sliced eggs on every section of the pasta; cover with 1/2 of the mozzarella cheese. Pour remaining pasta, Parmesan cheese, sauce, and mozzarella on top. Cover with aluminum foil.'),
('d756ed4c-43be-4532-8a1b-e192e4e4260d', 'ko', 'Spread a ladleful of sauce in the bottom of a 9x13-inch baking dish. Add 1/2 of the pasta, all of the ricotta cheese, peas, and 1/2 of the Parmesan cheese. Layer the sliced eggs on every section of the pasta; cover with 1/2 of the mozzarella cheese. Pour remaining pasta, Parmesan cheese, sauce, and mozzarella on top. Cover with aluminum foil.'),
('af231184-0483-43b5-832c-875f3ce30134', 'en', 'Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown and bubbly, 40 to 50 minutes. Let stand for about 10 minutes before cutting, so slices don''t fall apart.'),
('af231184-0483-43b5-832c-875f3ce30134', 'ko', 'Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown and bubbly, 40 to 50 minutes. Let stand for about 10 minutes before cutting, so slices don''t fall apart.'),
('e13f8006-91f8-43cf-8f3c-6c0296e2a1b0', 'en', 'Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (180 degrees C). Lightly oil a loaf pan.'),
('e13f8006-91f8-43cf-8f3c-6c0296e2a1b0', 'ko', 'Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (180 degrees C). Lightly oil a loaf pan.'),
('6240f8f2-8afc-4b4d-8354-46204d55b7a8', 'en', 'Heat 1 tablespoon vegetable oil in a nonstick skillet over medium-high heat and sauté yellow onions with a pinch of salt until they start to turn golden, 3 to 5 minutes. Stir in 3 cloves crushed garlic and 2 teaspoons ginger, and cook for 1 minute more. Remove from heat and let cool to room temperature, about 15 minutes.'),
('6240f8f2-8afc-4b4d-8354-46204d55b7a8', 'ko', 'Heat 1 tablespoon vegetable oil in a nonstick skillet over medium-high heat and sauté yellow onions with a pinch of salt until they start to turn golden, 3 to 5 minutes. Stir in 3 cloves crushed garlic and 2 teaspoons ginger, and cook for 1 minute more. Remove from heat and let cool to room temperature, about 15 minutes.'),
('4cfff9ae-6928-4e81-8e7c-f0465dd2cde6', 'en', 'Add cooled onion mixture to ground beef along with rice, egg, green onions, 1 tablespoon soy sauce, salt, and black pepper. Use a fork, spatula, or your hands to mix together until evenly combined. Transfer to the prepared loaf pan, press in firmly, and smooth the top.'),
('4cfff9ae-6928-4e81-8e7c-f0465dd2cde6', 'ko', 'Add cooled onion mixture to ground beef along with rice, egg, green onions, 1 tablespoon soy sauce, salt, and black pepper. Use a fork, spatula, or your hands to mix together until evenly combined. Transfer to the prepared loaf pan, press in firmly, and smooth the top.'),
('141bad4b-836b-4939-8b92-a99f689f8545', 'en', 'Bake in the preheated oven until an instant read thermometer inserted in the center reads 145 to 150 degrees F (63 to 65 degrees C), about 1 hour. Meatloaf can be served hot, or let cool, wrap and refrigerate until chilled, about 45 minutes.'),
('141bad4b-836b-4939-8b92-a99f689f8545', 'ko', 'Bake in the preheated oven until an instant read thermometer inserted in the center reads 145 to 150 degrees F (63 to 65 degrees C), about 1 hour. Meatloaf can be served hot, or let cool, wrap and refrigerate until chilled, about 45 minutes.'),
('cbfb2ceb-1ecb-437e-832a-a84c82b0a986', 'en', 'For the sauce, combine 2 teaspoons oil, 1 tablespoon ginger, and 4 minced garlic cloves in a cold nonstick skillet.'),
('cbfb2ceb-1ecb-437e-832a-a84c82b0a986', 'ko', 'For the sauce, combine 2 teaspoons oil, 1 tablespoon ginger, and 4 minced garlic cloves in a cold nonstick skillet.'),
('d108b6ed-b821-48b3-8410-0de4c05db4b9', 'en', 'Turn heat on to medium-high. Once ginger and garlic start to sizzle, cook, stirring, for about 30 seconds, then whisk in brown sugar, 1/2 cup soy sauce, 1/4 cup water, ketchup, and red pepper flakes. Bring to a simmer, then reduce heat to low.'),
('d108b6ed-b821-48b3-8410-0de4c05db4b9', 'ko', 'Turn heat on to medium-high. Once ginger and garlic start to sizzle, cook, stirring, for about 30 seconds, then whisk in brown sugar, 1/2 cup soy sauce, 1/4 cup water, ketchup, and red pepper flakes. Bring to a simmer, then reduce heat to low.'),
('51b7b24c-eefe-4f68-8646-a2fbaf547087', 'en', 'Whisk 1 teaspoon cornstarch with 2 teaspoons water together in a small bowl to make a slurry; stir into the sauce. Raise heat to medium-high and return to a simmer. Cook, whisking occasionally, until sauce thickens slightly, about 2 minutes. Reduce heat to low and keep warm until needed (Sauce may be made ahead and reheated on medium-low heat).'),
('51b7b24c-eefe-4f68-8646-a2fbaf547087', 'ko', 'Whisk 1 teaspoon cornstarch with 2 teaspoons water together in a small bowl to make a slurry; stir into the sauce. Raise heat to medium-high and return to a simmer. Cook, whisking occasionally, until sauce thickens slightly, about 2 minutes. Reduce heat to low and keep warm until needed (Sauce may be made ahead and reheated on medium-low heat).'),
('80cb89b8-b920-44b2-874a-8946e2252eb5', 'en', 'Remove cold meatloaf from the refrigerator and slice into 8 portions. Dust each side with cornstarch, and reheat over medium high heat in a nonstick skillet in a little bit of vegetable oil until browned and heated through. If surface browns before meatloaf is heated through, reduce heat to medium, and cover until done.'),
('80cb89b8-b920-44b2-874a-8946e2252eb5', 'ko', 'Remove cold meatloaf from the refrigerator and slice into 8 portions. Dust each side with cornstarch, and reheat over medium high heat in a nonstick skillet in a little bit of vegetable oil until browned and heated through. If surface browns before meatloaf is heated through, reduce heat to medium, and cover until done.'),
('2d80dbf1-c236-42c5-85e7-bb5eb4fd82e6', 'en', 'Serve topped with the sauce; garnish with toasted sesame seeds, sliced green onions, and chopped cilantro if desired.'),
('2d80dbf1-c236-42c5-85e7-bb5eb4fd82e6', 'ko', 'Serve topped with the sauce; garnish with toasted sesame seeds, sliced green onions, and chopped cilantro if desired.'),
('7137fe37-29e3-40e2-8d64-f8dc01c80154', 'en', 'Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C).'),
('7137fe37-29e3-40e2-8d64-f8dc01c80154', 'ko', 'Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C).'),
('026ddf9f-5a16-4e67-826f-38aa7ef1cc9e', 'en', 'Make the pork: Remove the netting or strings from pork roast, keeping them intact to use again. Combine rosemary, parsley, garlic, 3 teaspoons oil, 1 tablespoon kosher salt, and 1 tablespoon pepper in a bowl. Slice open pork roast and spread it with herb mixture. Roll up pork and secure it with the netting or string. Rub remaining 1 teaspoon oil all over pork; season with more salt and pepper.'),
('026ddf9f-5a16-4e67-826f-38aa7ef1cc9e', 'ko', 'Make the pork: Remove the netting or strings from pork roast, keeping them intact to use again. Combine rosemary, parsley, garlic, 3 teaspoons oil, 1 tablespoon kosher salt, and 1 tablespoon pepper in a bowl. Slice open pork roast and spread it with herb mixture. Roll up pork and secure it with the netting or string. Rub remaining 1 teaspoon oil all over pork; season with more salt and pepper.'),
('553b22e9-2f0f-46c2-8853-1e496f4f6d14', 'en', 'Place pork, fat-side up, in a roasting pan; pour in water.'),
('553b22e9-2f0f-46c2-8853-1e496f4f6d14', 'ko', 'Place pork, fat-side up, in a roasting pan; pour in water.'),
('8737326d-7b6f-4b9d-8d8d-2c89fa7f6d05', 'en', 'Bake in the preheated oven, basting occasionally and adding more water if necessary, until an instant-read thermometer inserted into the meat reads at least 145 degrees F (63 degrees C), 1 1/2 to 2 hours. Remove from the oven and let rest for 10 to 15 minutes. Reserve pan juices in the roasting pan.'),
('8737326d-7b6f-4b9d-8d8d-2c89fa7f6d05', 'ko', 'Bake in the preheated oven, basting occasionally and adding more water if necessary, until an instant-read thermometer inserted into the meat reads at least 145 degrees F (63 degrees C), 1 1/2 to 2 hours. Remove from the oven and let rest for 10 to 15 minutes. Reserve pan juices in the roasting pan.'),
('a3b62f32-0005-4da3-8ac2-bd9f50508bfc', 'en', 'While the pork is resting, prepare fixings: Heat oil in a frying pan over medium heat. Stir in garlic and red pepper flakes; cook and stir until garlic is fragrant but not brown, about 3 minutes. Pour in chicken stock and bring to a boil. Add spinach, lemon juice, salt, and pepper. Reduce the heat to medium-low and cook, stirring occasionally, until spinach is wilted, 2 to 3 minutes.'),
('a3b62f32-0005-4da3-8ac2-bd9f50508bfc', 'ko', 'While the pork is resting, prepare fixings: Heat oil in a frying pan over medium heat. Stir in garlic and red pepper flakes; cook and stir until garlic is fragrant but not brown, about 3 minutes. Pour in chicken stock and bring to a boil. Add spinach, lemon juice, salt, and pepper. Reduce the heat to medium-low and cook, stirring occasionally, until spinach is wilted, 2 to 3 minutes.'),
('db66df08-1482-4a10-8a96-068df1801a31', 'en', 'Cut and remove the string from the roast. Cut pork into thin slices. Return sliced pork to the juices in the roasting pan.'),
('db66df08-1482-4a10-8a96-068df1801a31', 'ko', 'Cut and remove the string from the roast. Cut pork into thin slices. Return sliced pork to the juices in the roasting pan.'),
('b307a53a-584d-488b-8d27-25313600cf17', 'en', 'Slice sandwich rolls. Sprinkle Manchego cheese over split rolls, add pork slices, and top with spinach.'),
('b307a53a-584d-488b-8d27-25313600cf17', 'ko', 'Slice sandwich rolls. Sprinkle Manchego cheese over split rolls, add pork slices, and top with spinach.'),
('b9732f96-6929-43ea-893f-b6142b5dfd17', 'en', 'Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Butter an 8x8-inch baking dish.'),
('b9732f96-6929-43ea-893f-b6142b5dfd17', 'ko', 'Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Butter an 8x8-inch baking dish.'),
('ab83948b-a04a-4046-80ac-da22c93c1b61', 'en', 'Fit a food processor with a shredding disk and use it to shred cheese. Transfer to a small bowl. Fit processor with slicing disk and use it to slice potatoes.'),
('ab83948b-a04a-4046-80ac-da22c93c1b61', 'ko', 'Fit a food processor with a shredding disk and use it to shred cheese. Transfer to a small bowl. Fit processor with slicing disk and use it to slice potatoes.'),
('69dde5ce-37d9-468b-8072-bfd5d55b78be', 'en', 'Put potatoes in a large saucepan with half-and-half, garlic, salt, and nutmeg; stir gently to combine. Bring to a boil over medium-high heat, stirring occasionally. Cook at a gentle boil, stirring often with a heat-safe spatula to prevent sticking, until half-and-half has reduced and thickly coats potatoes, about 8 minutes.'),
('69dde5ce-37d9-468b-8072-bfd5d55b78be', 'ko', 'Put potatoes in a large saucepan with half-and-half, garlic, salt, and nutmeg; stir gently to combine. Bring to a boil over medium-high heat, stirring occasionally. Cook at a gentle boil, stirring often with a heat-safe spatula to prevent sticking, until half-and-half has reduced and thickly coats potatoes, about 8 minutes.'),
('7dbed613-8f4f-426b-87a8-b8a84f6a3e15', 'en', 'Spoon into prepared baking dish. Smooth top and sprinkle evenly with cheese.'),
('7dbed613-8f4f-426b-87a8-b8a84f6a3e15', 'ko', 'Spoon into prepared baking dish. Smooth top and sprinkle evenly with cheese.'),
('814674d3-7787-4c92-852e-d8e779774f29', 'en', 'Bake in preheated oven until potatoes are tender when pierced with a knife and top is golden brown, 25 to 30 minutes. Let stand 5 to 10 minutes before serving.'),
('814674d3-7787-4c92-852e-d8e779774f29', 'ko', 'Bake in preheated oven until potatoes are tender when pierced with a knife and top is golden brown, 25 to 30 minutes. Let stand 5 to 10 minutes before serving.'),
('d0fbbd14-ca65-4431-8106-6bcfcb49e2d2', 'en', 'First make the syrup: Add white sugar, water, cinnamon stick, and citrus peel to a medium saucepan. Place over medium heat and bring to a boil. Once boiling, boil for 2 minutes and remove from heat. Let cool completely. (This can be done up to a week in advance; store the cooled syrup in the refrigerator until needed.)'),
('d0fbbd14-ca65-4431-8106-6bcfcb49e2d2', 'ko', 'First make the syrup: Add white sugar, water, cinnamon stick, and citrus peel to a medium saucepan. Place over medium heat and bring to a boil. Once boiling, boil for 2 minutes and remove from heat. Let cool completely. (This can be done up to a week in advance; store the cooled syrup in the refrigerator until needed.)'),
('0fe5e991-3dff-4e5f-8f1c-8e4bbe03beeb', 'en', 'Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (180 degrees C). Brush a 9x13-inch baking dish with some of the melted butter.'),
('0fe5e991-3dff-4e5f-8f1c-8e4bbe03beeb', 'ko', 'Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (180 degrees C). Brush a 9x13-inch baking dish with some of the melted butter.'),
('58a43738-3a1e-4d81-8b7e-37c0a23d7e9f', 'en', 'Place walnut halves in a food processor and pulse several times until they resemble fine crumbs. Combine walnuts with shredded pumpkin, breadcrumbs, olive oil, sugar, cinnamon, and ground cloves. Stir until well combined.'),
('58a43738-3a1e-4d81-8b7e-37c0a23d7e9f', 'ko', 'Place walnut halves in a food processor and pulse several times until they resemble fine crumbs. Combine walnuts with shredded pumpkin, breadcrumbs, olive oil, sugar, cinnamon, and ground cloves. Stir until well combined.'),
('51f0e247-9d6c-4c2f-8437-d770ae57dd71', 'en', 'Unroll phyllo dough and remove one sheet from the stack. Cover remaining phyllo with a dampened tea towel to keep from drying out as you work. Brush the sheet of dough with melted butter and lay in the prepared baking dish; press lightly so the sheet covers the bottom of the dish and comes up the sides. Repeat until you have 8 sheets layered. Do not worry if there are some tears in any of the sheets, this is expected and won''t affect the final result!'),
('51f0e247-9d6c-4c2f-8437-d770ae57dd71', 'ko', 'Unroll phyllo dough and remove one sheet from the stack. Cover remaining phyllo with a dampened tea towel to keep from drying out as you work. Brush the sheet of dough with melted butter and lay in the prepared baking dish; press lightly so the sheet covers the bottom of the dish and comes up the sides. Repeat until you have 8 sheets layered. Do not worry if there are some tears in any of the sheets, this is expected and won''t affect the final result!'),
('6b6a650f-9d72-4b41-8aa0-e60828a62304', 'en', 'Spoon the pumpkin mixture over the phyllo base and level out to the sides. Fold the overhanging phyllo over the top of the pumpkin mixture.'),
('6b6a650f-9d72-4b41-8aa0-e60828a62304', 'ko', 'Spoon the pumpkin mixture over the phyllo base and level out to the sides. Fold the overhanging phyllo over the top of the pumpkin mixture.'),
('7f90c827-f05d-4aaf-8a91-ff62ba3e7706', 'en', 'Brush another sheet of phyllo dough with melted butter and lay over the pumpkin mixture. Repeat until you''ve topped with 6 to 8 sheets. Use your pastry brush to scrunch the overhanging phyllo down into the sides of the baking dish. Drizzle any remaining melted butter all over the top of the baklava.'),
('7f90c827-f05d-4aaf-8a91-ff62ba3e7706', 'ko', 'Brush another sheet of phyllo dough with melted butter and lay over the pumpkin mixture. Repeat until you''ve topped with 6 to 8 sheets. Use your pastry brush to scrunch the overhanging phyllo down into the sides of the baking dish. Drizzle any remaining melted butter all over the top of the baklava.'),
('2baf2541-1327-4ae2-8116-0fa26a5754f8', 'en', 'Using a sharp knife, cut into diamond or square shapes all the way through the top layers of phyllo; do not cut through the bottom layers.'),
('2baf2541-1327-4ae2-8116-0fa26a5754f8', 'ko', 'Using a sharp knife, cut into diamond or square shapes all the way through the top layers of phyllo; do not cut through the bottom layers.'),
('025e999e-853b-4698-84b8-b2420c07f0c6', 'en', 'Bake in the preheated oven until the phyllo is a deep golden brown, 50 to 60 minutes.'),
('025e999e-853b-4698-84b8-b2420c07f0c6', 'ko', 'Bake in the preheated oven until the phyllo is a deep golden brown, 50 to 60 minutes.'),
('2a9c9e27-62d8-49a5-8762-aef9c0d6e61e', 'en', 'Remove baklava from the oven and immediately ladle the cool syrup over the hot baklava. Add one ladleful at a time until all of the syrup has been added.'),
('2a9c9e27-62d8-49a5-8762-aef9c0d6e61e', 'ko', 'Remove baklava from the oven and immediately ladle the cool syrup over the hot baklava. Add one ladleful at a time until all of the syrup has been added.'),
('cf7786af-fc58-42a8-8b9c-6e1dea57155e', 'en', 'Set aside and let rest, uncovered, for 8 hours or overnight before serving.'),
('cf7786af-fc58-42a8-8b9c-6e1dea57155e', 'ko', 'Set aside and let rest, uncovered, for 8 hours or overnight before serving.');
